.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2F8-killed-as-plane-crashes-on-second-attempt-amid-heavy-fog-in-us-alaska-11943071%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Oura%20exploring%20how%20its%20ring%20could%20detect%20brain%20hemorrhages%20after%20Bill%20Ackman%20suggests%20it%20could%20have%20helped%20his%20daughter%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223727%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bill%20Ackman%20sits%20in%20a%20studio%20wearing%20a%20dark%20suit%2C%20white%20shirt%2C%20red%20patterned%20tie%2C%20and%20lapel%20microphone.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88d2e34569a4ec219f91de%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222415%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJohn%20Lamparski%2FBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EBill%20Ackman%20said%20he%20wished%20his%20daughter's%20Oura%20Ring%20could%20have%20detected%20her%20brain%20hemorrhage.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOura%20CEO%20Tom%20Hale%20said%20in%20response%20that%20the%20company%20is%20looking%20into%20this.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAckman%20said%20they%20used%20the%20Oura%20ring%20after%20the%20fact%20to%20determine%20when%20the%20hemorrhage%20had%20occurred.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOura%20is%20looking%20into%20how%20its%20smart%20ring%20could%20be%20used%20to%20detect%20brain%20hemorrhages%20after%20billionaire%20investor%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbill-ackman-stock-portfolio-pershing-square-ai-nflx-ice-spgi-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBill%20Ackman%3C%2Fa%3E%20suggested%20such%20a%20feature%20could%20have%20helped%20his%20daughter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAckman%2C%20founder%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbill-ackman-investment-fund-pershing-square-files-for-an-ipo-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EPershing%20Square%20Capital%20Management%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20shared%20this%20week%20that%20his%2026-year-old%20daughter%2C%20Lucy%2C%20experienced%20a%20brain%20hemorrhage%20in%20February.%20He%20said%20data%20from%20her%20Oura%20Ring%20later%20helped%20determine%20when%20the%20hemorrhage%20had%20occurred%2C%20which%20was%20many%20hours%20before%20she%20was%20found%20unconscious%2C%20brought%20to%20a%20hospital%2C%20diagnosed%2C%20and%20rushed%20into%20surgery%20at%20around%203%20a.m.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BLater%20that%20day%2C%20we%20determined%20from%20Lucy's%20Oura%20ring%20that%20her%20hemorrhage%20had%20occurred%20around%209am%2C%20which%20meant%20that%20more%20than%2019%20hours%20had%20passed%20from%20the%20time%20of%20the%20hemorrhage%20to%20the%20completion%20of%20the%20surgery%20to%20release%20the%20pressure%20on%20her%20brain%2C%26quot%3B%20Ackman%20wrote%20in%20a%20lengthy%20X%20post%20on%20Wednesday%2C%20adding%2C%20%26quot%3BI%20only%20wish%20%40ouraring%20had%20an%20alert%20for%20this%20kind%20of%20a%20medical%20event.%20Imagine%20it%20could%20call%20a%20family%20member%20if%20the%20wearer%20doesn't%20cancel%20the%20alert.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20response%20to%20Ackman's%20post%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Foura-ring-health-payments-digital-id-ceo-tom-hale-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETom%20Hale%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20CEO%20of%20Oura%2C%20said%20Friday%20the%20company%20was%20looking%20into%20exactly%20that.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20am%20glad%20that%20the%20insights%20from%20Lucy's%20Oura%20Ring%20were%20able%20to%20give%20you%20and%20your%20family%20information%20that%20helped%20inform%20her%20care.%20I%20wish%20we%20had%20been%20able%20to%20predict%20or%20detect%20what%20happened%2C%26quot%3B%20Hale%20said%20in%20a%20reply%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BI%20keep%20coming%20back%20to%20the%20question%20of%20whether%20Oura%20could%20have%20seen%20anything%20that%20might%20have%20helped%20and%20then%20alerted%20Lucy.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHale%20said%20he%20directed%20his%20team%20to%20investigate%20whether%20its%20ring%20could%20detect%20a%20medical%20event%20like%20this.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20reached%20for%20comment%2C%20Oura%20directed%20Business%20Insider%20to%20Hale's%20post.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Foura-ring-4-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOura%20Ring%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20among%20the%20most%20popular%20wearable%20wellness%20trackers%20on%20the%20market.%20The%20ring%20tracks%20metrics%20such%20as%20heart%20rate%2C%20sleep%20stages%2C%20body%20temperature%2C%20and%20daily%20movement%2C%20though%20the%20company%20website%20states%20that%20the%20ring%20is%20not%20a%20medical%20device%20and%20is%20not%20intended%20to%20diagnose%2C%20monitor%2C%20or%20prevent%20medical%20conditions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAckman%20said%20his%20daughter%2C%20who%20was%20in%20a%20coma%20for%20several%20weeks%2C%20spent%20six%20months%20in%20the%20hospital%20and%20is%20still%20recovering.%20He%20said%20she%20has%20regained%20her%20cognition%20and%20is%20making%20progress%20on%20walking%20and%20speaking%2C%20but%20that%20she%20has%20not%20regained%20her%20vision.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAckman%20announced%20that%20he%20and%20his%20wife%2C%20designer%20Neri%20Oxman%2C%20were%20launching%20the%20Ackman%20Oxman%20Institute%2C%20a%20nonprofit%20focused%20on%20brain%20research%2C%20recovery%2C%20and%20longevity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20learned%20from%20Lucy%20that%20the%20brain%20can%20recover%20from%20even%20catastrophic%20injury%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BThere%20is%20so%20much%20more%20work%20to%20be%20done%20as%20the%20mind%20is%20a%20terrible%20thing%20to%20waste.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EKim%20Schewitz%20contributed%20reporting.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbill-ackman-daughter-oura-ring-ceo-detecting-brain-hemorrhage-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787354322000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8