tent%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227478%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20statue%20of%20Walt%20Disney%20and%20Mickey%20Mouse%20at%20Disneyland%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88a3544569a4ec219f907a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224957%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EChristina%20House%20%2F%20Los%20Angeles%20Times%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EDisney%20will%20cut%20medical%20coverage%20for%20US%20employees'%20spouses%20who%20can%20get%20insurance%20through%20their%20own%20jobs.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20move%20comes%20as%20US%20employers%20brace%20for%20another%20big%20increase%20in%20healthcare%20expenses%20next%20year.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESome%20big%20companies%2C%20including%20Deloitte%2C%20are%20planning%20to%20trim%20other%20employee%20benefits.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EDisney%20is%20joining%20other%20big-name%20companies%20in%20curbing%20employee%20benefits%2C%20a%20move%20that%20comes%20as%20healthcare%20costs%20rise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStarting%20next%20year%2C%20the%20entertainment%20giant%20will%20no%20longer%20offer%20medical%20insurance%20plans%20to%20US%20employees'%20spouses%20if%20their%20spouses%20have%20jobs%20that%20provide%20such%20coverage%2C%20a%20Disney%20spokesperson%20confirmed%20to%20Business%20Insider.%20Employees'%20other%20dependents%20won't%20be%20impacted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BLike%20a%20growing%20number%20of%20large%20employers%2C%20we're%20making%20measured%20adjustments%20to%20our%20employee%20benefits%20in%20response%20to%20rising%20healthcare%20costs%20nationwide%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20company%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20policy%20change%20at%20Disney%2C%20which%20doesn't%20apply%20to%20dental%20or%20vision%20benefits%20for%20workers'%20spouses%2C%20was%20first%20reported%20by%20the%20news%20outlet%20Puck.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJoshua%20Lavine%2C%20CEO%20of%20Capitol%20Benefits%2C%20an%20insurance%20advisory%20firm%2C%20described%20Disney's%20move%20as%20highly%20unusual.%20%26quot%3BWe've%20seen%20employers%20reducing%20their%20contribution%20toward%20the%20spouse's%20coverage%2C%20but%20not%20eliminating%20the%20coverage%20option%20for%20those%20people%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThough%20Disney's%20policy%20change%20doesn't%20affect%20employees'%20spouses%20who%20are%20unemployed%20or%20have%20jobs%20that%20don't%20provide%20medical%20insurance%2C%20Lavine%20said%20it%20could%20create%20problems%20for%20those%20who%20are%20undergoing%20long-term%20health%20treatments.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere%20are%20so%20many%20options%20for%20employers%20right%20now%20to%20make%20coverage%20available%20to%20employees%20that%20this%20is%20really%20the%20extreme%2C%20nothing-else-can-work%20solution%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BA%20better%20solution%20is%20to%20reduce%2C%20or%20if%20you%20have%20to%2C%20eliminate%20the%20employer%20contribution%20for%20spouses.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c2a69c52-7f1e-4102-9314-1845113d5065%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ERising%20healthcare%20costs%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EDisney%20also%20plans%20to%20introduce%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-plans-employee-stock-purchase-program-health-insurance-plan-changes-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eemployee%20stock-purchase%20program%3C%2Fa%3E%20later%20in%202027%2C%20pending%20approvals%2C%20Business%20Insider%20previously%20reported.%20The%20company%20had%20about%20172%2C000%20US%20employees%20as%20of%20September%202025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Mouse%20House's%20move%20to%20limit%20spousal%20medical%20coverage%20comes%20as%20US%20employers'%20healthcare%20expenses%20are%20projected%20to%20rise%209.5%25%20next%20year%2C%20marking%20the%20fourth%20consecutive%20near-double-digit%20annual%20increase%2C%20according%20to%20a%20report%20released%20Thursday%20by%20Aon.%20The%20increase%20extends%20one%20of%20the%20most%20sustained%20periods%20of%20healthcare%20inflation%20that%20employers%20have%20faced%20in%20decades%2C%20the%20insurance%20brokerage%20giant%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20big%20employers%20are%20also%20introducing%20cost-cutting%20measures.%20Starbucks%20recently%20said%20it%20would%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarbucks-cuts-glp-1-coverage-weight-loss-costs-climb-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eno%20longer%20cover%20GLP-1%3C%2Fa%3E%20medications%20prescribed%20for%20weight%20loss%20for%20benefits-eligible%20employees%20starting%20in%20October.%20The%20coffee%20chain%20offers%20health%20benefits%20to%20full-%20and%20part-time%20employees%20who%20work%20at%20least%2020%20hours%20a%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMore%20businesses%20may%20follow%20their%20lead.%20In%20a%20survey%20conducted%20this%20spring%2C%20nearly%20half%20of%20US%20employers%20with%20500%20or%20more%20employees%20surveyed%20by%20Mercer%20said%20they%20plan%20to%20make%20changes%20to%20their%20medical%20plans%20next%20year%2C%20such%20as%20raising%20deductibles%20or%20copays.%20Those%20changes%20would%20result%20in%20higher%20out-of-pocket%20costs%20for%20workers%2C%20the%20benefits-consulting%20firm%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20companies%20are%20making%20cuts%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdeloitte-zoom-are-shrinking-popular-benefits-will-others-follow-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eother%20types%20of%20employee%20benefits%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Business%20Insider%20previously%20reported%20that%20Zoom%20reduced%20its%20paid%20parental%20leave%20this%20year%2C%20while%20Deloitte%20plans%20to%20do%20the%20same%20for%20some%20of%20its%20US%20employees%2C%20as%20well%20as%20cutting%20or%20paring%20back%20annual%20PTO%2C%20a%20pension%20plan%2C%20and%20IVF%20funding%2C%20starting%20in%20January.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-spouse-healthcare-coverage-employe