%20more%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cdiv%3E%3Ciframe%20width%3D%5C%22100%25%5C%22%20title%3D%5C%22How%20Uber%20uses%20AI%20to%20charge%20you%20more%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jwplayer.com%2Fplayers%2FXwu3ZZnO-.html%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22100%25%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fiframe%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EUber%20once%20sold%20riders%20on%20a%20simple%20promise%3A%20Order%20a%20car%20right%20from%20your%20phone%20for%20less%20than%20a%20taxi.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20major%20change%20happened%20behind%20the%20scenes%3A%20up-front%20pricing.%20Instead%20of%20relying%20on%20a%20predictable%20rate%20based%20largely%20on%20time%20and%20distance%2C%20Uber%20now%20uses%20algorithms%20and%20a%20range%20of%20real-time%20factors%20to%20determine%20what%20riders%20pay%20and%20what%20drivers%20earn.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20then%2C%20prices%20have%20risen%20dramatically.%20From%202018%20to%202022%2C%20average%20Uber%20fares%20in%20the%20US%20rose%2083%25%2C%20nearly%20four%20times%20the%20annual%20rate%20of%20inflation.%20And%20when%20Business%20Insider%20employees%20requested%20the%20same%20UberX%20ride%20at%20the%20same%20time%2C%20the%20highest%20fare%20was%20nearly%2021%25%20more%20expensive%20than%20the%20lowest.%20A%20larger%20Consumer%20Reports%20test%20of%20Uber%20and%20Lyft%20found%20even%20wider%20gaps%20on%20some%20routes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECritics%20accuse%20Uber%20of%20using%20AI%20and%20algorithms%20to%20extract%20the%20most%20money%20from%20consumers%20while%20paying%20drivers%20the%20least.%20Uber%20flatly%20denies%20using%20personalized%20data%20and%20cites%20higher%20costs%20and%20a%20post-pandemic%20driver%20shortage%20among%20the%20reasons%20prices%20have%20skyrocketed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20how%20does%20Uber%20actually%20set%20your%20fare%3F%20And%20what%20is%20the%20real%20reason%20Uber%20rides%20are%20so%20expensive%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-uber-uses-ai-to-charge-you-more-