C%22published%22%3A1787342727000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236840365%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22TikTok%2C%20the%20company%20behind%20the%20namesake%20popular%20short-form%20video%20app%2C%20has%20agreed%20to%20pay%20%24400%20million%20to%20settle%20a%20U.S.%20government%20lawsuit%20alleging%20it%20violated%20the%20country%E2%80%99s%20Children%E2%80%99s%20Online%20Privacy%20Protection%20Act%20(COPPA).%20The%20Justice%20Department%20announced%20the%20settlement%20with%20TikTok%20and%20China-based%20ByteDance%20on%20Friday.%20Under%20the%20terms%20of%20the%20agreement%2C%20TikTok%20will%20pay%20%5B%E2%80%A6%5D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Todd%20Spangler%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22LISTEN%3A%20Amazon%20Courts%20Creators%20to%20Build%20Businesses%20and%20Scale%20the%20Attention%20Economy%20for%20Brands%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787342483000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236840205%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22On%20today%E2%80%99s%20episode%20of%20Variety%E2%80%98s%20%E2%80%9CStrictly%20Business%E2%80%9D%20podcast%2C%20Matt%20Sandler%20and%20Angie%20More%20of%20Amazon%20explain%20how%20the%20digital%20behemoth%20is%20diving%20in%20to%20the%20creator%20economy%20to%20build%20business%20and%20bring%20scale%20in%20ad%20buying%20to%20big%20brands.%20Sandler%2C%20who%20is%20Amazon%E2%80%99s%20general%20manager%20of%20creator%20services%2C%20and%20More%2C%20head%20of%20creator%20ad%20partnerships%2C%20%5B%E2%80%A6%5D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Cynthia%20Littleton%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Devoted%20Health%20is%20raising%20a%20new%20round%20of%20funding%20at%20a%20%2425%20billion%20valuation%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Medicare%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6b7c5997a2276a3423b38a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMedicare%20advantage%3Cp%3EPatrick%20T.%20Fallon%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EHealthcare%20startup%20Devoted%20Health%20is%20raising%20a%20new%20round%20of%20funding.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20round%20could%20value%20the%20healthcare%20company%20at%20%2425%20billion.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EDevoted%20Health%20was%20founded%20by%20brothers%20and%20former%20healthcare%20executives%20Ed%20and%20Todd%20Park%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EDevoted%20Health%20is%20the%20latest%20startup%20to%20show%20that%20combining%20health%20and%20AI%20commands%20a%20premium%20valuation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJust%20months%20after%20announcing%20a%20new%20round%20of%20funding%2C%20the%20Medicare%20Advantage%20startup%20is%20in%20talks%20to%20raise%20another%20round%20that%20could%20value%20the%20company%20at%20%2425%20billion%2C%20according%20to%20sources%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20a%20jump%20from%20the%20company's%20%2416%20billion%20valuation%20in%20a%20funding%20round%20raised%20earlier%20this%20year%2C%20according%20to%20sources.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDevoted%20Health%2C%20which%20is%20based%20in%20Waltham%2C%20Massachusetts%2C%20was%20founded%20in%202017%20by%20brothers%20and%20former%20healthcare%20executives%20Ed%20and%20Todd%20Park.%20The%20startup%20combines%20health%20insurance%20and%20medical%20care%20for%20elderly%20people%20enrolled%20in%20the%20Medicare%20Advantage%20market.%20The%20company's%20proprietary%20AI%20tool%2C%20Orinoco%2C%20helps%20coordinate%20medical%20care%20for%20members.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEd%20Park%20was%20previously%20the%20COO%20of%20athenahealth%2C%20and%20Todd%20Park%20was%20the%20chief%20technology%20officer%20of%20the%20United%20States%20in%20the%20Obama%20administration.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20do%20not%20comment%20on%20our%20capital%20raising%20activity%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20a%20company%20spokesperson.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20fundraising%20reflects%20growing%20investor%20enthusiasm%20for%20healthcare%20companies%20that%20use%20AI%20to%20improve%20both%20patient%20care%20and%20the%20economics%20of%20medicine.%20The%20back-to-back%20rounds%20could%20also%20signal%20investor%20confidence%20in%20Devoted's%20ability%20to%20scale%20in%20one%20of%20healthcare's%20largest%20and%20fastest-growing%20markets.%20Medicare%20Advantage%20has%20become%20a%20battleground%20for%20both%20incumbent%20insurers%20and%20venture-backed%20startups.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMedicare%20Advantage%20is%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Falignment-healthcare-devoted-health-startups-medicare-advantage-membership-market-2024-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eprivate%20alternative%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20the%20traditional%20Medicare%20program%20that%20provides%20health%20coverage%20to%20people%2065%20and%20older%20and%20people%20with%20disabilities.%20The%20program%20has%20grown%20rapidly%20over%20the%20past%20decade%2C%20with%20enrollment%20more%20than%20doubling.%20That%20boom%20has%20attracted%20both%20insurance%20giants%20and%20venture-backed%20startups%20eager%20to%20tap%20into%20the%20hundreds%20of%20billions%20of%20dollars%20the%20federal%20government%20spends%20on%20the%20program%20annually.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDevoted%20generates%20revenue%20primarily%20through%20government-funded%20Medicare%20Advantage%20premiums%2C%20making%20it%20part%20insurer%20and%20part%20healthcare%20provider.%20The%20company%20had%20466%2C000%20members%20as%20of%20January%202026%2C%20a%20year-over-year%20increase%20of%20121%25.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDevoted%20Health's%20investors%20include%20Andreessen%20Horowitz%2C%20Venrock%2C%20General%20Catalyst%2C%20Iconiq%2C%20and%20Emerson%20Collective%2C%20according%20to%20PitchBook.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhealthcare-startup-devoted-health-could-be-valued-at-25-billion-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787342306000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6b7c96a62e6e00bc53877b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhealthcare-startup-devoted-health-could-be-valued-at-25-billion-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Devoted%20Health%2C%20co-founded%20by%20Ed%20and%20Todd%20Park%2C%20is%20raising%20a%20round%20that%20might%20value%20it%20at%20%2425B%2C%20spotlighting%20the%20booming%20Medicare%20Advantage%20sector.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22kroof%40businessinsider.com%20(Katie%20Roof)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22These%20smartphones%20on%20soldiers'%20chests%20are%20becoming%20an%20important%20tool%20in%20the%20US%20Army's%20plans%20for%20a%20high-tech%20fight%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20US%20Army%20soldier%20looks%20down%20at%20their%20End%20User%20Device%20while%20holding%20an%20antenna%20for%20a%20drone%20in%20the%20desert.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a888a2e4569a4ec219f8f28%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20End%20User%20Devices%20are%20attached%20to%20soldiers'%20chests%20and%20run%20on%20batteries%20carried%20on%20their%20backs.%3Cp%3EUS%20Army%20photo%20by%20Sgt.%20Nathan%20Arellano%20Tlaczani%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EUS%20Army%20soldiers%20are%20using%20smartphones%20mounted%20on%20their%20chests%20for%20mapping%20and%20communicating.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESoldiers%20found%20the%20End%20User%20Devices%20useful%20but%20ran%20into%20connection%20issues%20and%20said%20they%20still%20need%20physical%20backups.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EArmy%20leaders%20used%20a%20recent%20exercise%20to%20assess%20how%20many%20soldiers%20should%20have%20the%20devices.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20soldiers%20stood%20at%20the%20edge%20of%20a%20building%2C%20readying%20to%20push%20deeper%20into%20the%20city%20for%20the%20next%20phase%20of%20the%20fight.%20Some%20checked%20their%20ammunition%2C%20while%20others%20mapped%20out%20their%20moves%20on%20the%20smartphones%20on%20their%20chests.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20US%20Army%20refers%20to%20the%20systems%20Business%20Insider%20saw%20used%20in%20this%20urban%20training%20scenario%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eas%20End%20User%20Devices%2C%20Samsung%20phones%20that%20have%20been%20stripped%2C%20ruggedized%2C%20and%20reprogrammed%20for%20soldiers.%20EUDs%20are%20home%20to%20new%20applications%20that%20Army%20leaders%20anticipate%20will%20improve%20battlefield%20awareness%20and%20speed%20up%20decision-making.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20devices%20reflect%20the%20Army's%20shift%20toward%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Farmy-on-move-future-war-hiding-command-posts-in-spectrum-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecommercially%20available%20technology%3C%2Fa%3E.%20While%20they've%20been%20in%20use%20for%20years%2C%20they're%20getting%20updated%20with%20new%20functions%20as%20the%20Army%20continues%20its%20major%20digital%20transformation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20a%20desert%20exercise%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftesting-new-tech-while-training-work-in-progress-us-army-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EProject%20Convergence%20Capstone%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20at%20Fort%20Irwin%20in%20California%20last%20month%2C%20roughly%2010%2C000%20soldiers%20gathered%20to%20engage%20in%20simulated%20large-scale%20combat%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-soldiers-working-out-how-to-use-drones-punishing-conditions-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etest%20new%20technologies%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20including%20drones%2C%20electronic%20warfare%20systems%2C%20and%20the%20Army's%20prototype%20command-and-control%20system%2C%20known%20as%20Next%20Generation%20Command%20and%20Control.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESoldiers%20were%20using%20EUDs%20inside%20carriers%20attached%20to%20their%20chests%20and%20powered%20by%20large%20batteries%20in%20cases%20on%20their%20backs.%20The%20smart%20devices%20were%20loaded%20with%20the%20Android%20Team%20Awareness%20Kit%2C%20or%20ATAK%2C%20application%2C%20which%20allowed%20users%20to%20access%20a%20real-time%20geospatial%20map%20that%20showed%20where%20they%20and%20their%20friendly%20forces%20were%20in%20the%20field%20and%20also%20rough%20locations%20of%20potential%20enemy%20forces.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20US%20Army%20soldier%20looks%20down%20at%20their%20End%20User%20Device.%20A%20truck%20is%20parked%20in%20the%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8889fc8a99fa493d60ee81%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ESoldiers%20used%20the%20devices%20to%20check%20locations%2C%20communicate%20with%20one%20another%2C%20and%20plan%20next%20steps.%3Cp%3EUS%20Army%20photo%20by%20Pfc.%20Craig%20Kong%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESoldiers%20were%20able%20to%20share%20map%20markers%20and%20photos%20with%20each%20other%20using%20these%20devices%2C%20which%20they%20said%20helped%20them%20communicate%20and%20make%20decisions%20more%20quickly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere's%20a%20chat%20feature%20on%20there%20that%20they%20can%20talk%20to%20me%20and%20provide%20me%20information%20and%20give%20me%20more%20detail%20that%20I%20might%20not%20be%20able%20to%20over%20the%20radio%2C%26quot%3B%20Capt.%20Dominic%20Sparkling%2C%20a%20unit%20commander%20within%20the%204th%20Infantry%20Division%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20EUDs%2C%20like%20elements%20of%20NGC2%2C%20can%20stay%20online%20via%20several%20means%20of%20connection%2C%20including%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-rapidly-built-digital-command-and-control-testing-experimenting-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esatellite%20or%20cellular%20networks%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Apps%20on%20the%20devices%20also%20have%20offline%20functions%20should%20soldiers%20lose%20connection%20or%20encounter%20jamming.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETroops%20ran%20into%20connectivity%20problems%20during%20the%20exercise%2C%20sometimes%20because%20of%20simulated%20electronic%20warfare%2C%20sometimes%20for%20other%20reasons.%20They%20said%20the%20problems%20could%20slow%20apps%20and%20information%20loading%20or%20leave%20maps%20short%20on%20detail.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EOne%20platoon%20sergeant%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20because%20his%20EUD%20wasn't%20connected%20to%20WiFi%2C%20%26quot%3Bit%20wasn't%20working%20properly.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20issues%20highlighted%20one%20of%20the%20central%20tensions%20of%20the%20Army's%20push%20for%20a%20more%20digital%20force.%20Soldiers%20can%20obtain%20valuable%20information%20through%20the%20network%2C%20which%20is%20designed%20to%20make%20them%20more%20effective%20in%20a%20high-intensity%2C%20high-tech%20fight.%20However%2C%20they%20still%20need%20to%20be%20prepared%20to%20fight%20when%20the%20network%20fails.%20During%20the%20exercise%2C%20troops%20used%20physical%20maps%20alongside%20their%20EUDs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESoldiers%20said%20they%20see%20the%20EUD%20as%20an%20ideal%20way%20to%20stay%20connected%20and%20receive%20information%2C%20but%20they%20keep%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-going-digital-soldiers-still-need-analog-backups-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ephysical%20backups%20for%20redundancy%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BDigital%20enables%20me%20to%20get%20real-time%2C%20precise%20targeting%20feedback%2C%20which%20has%20been%20critical%2C%26quot%3B%20Capt.%20Mohamed%20Elmaola%20with%20the%204th%20Infantry%20Division%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20But%20the%20%26quot%3Banalog%20copy%20is%20what%20I%20fight%20and%20live%20off%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ebecause%20this%20gives%20me%20the%20totality%20of%20the%20story%20of%20what%20the%20enemy%20is%20doing%2C%20especially%20in%20a%20degraded%20environment%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226855%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20US%20Army%20soldier%20pulls%20a%20drone%20out%20of%20its%20case%20in%20the%20desert.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7df037c78818eff7d2ca62%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224572%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EArmy%20leaders%20are%20deciding%20which%20soldiers%20should%20get%20EUDs%20depending%20on%20formations%20and%20duties.%3Cp%3EUS%20Army%20photo%20by%20Sgt.%20Nathan%20Arellano%20Tlaczani%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Army%20is%20figuring%20out%20who%20needs%20an%20EUD.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20number%20of%20devices%20in%20Army%20divisions%20varies%20with%20the%20type%20of%20formation%20and%20how%20soldiers%20are%20dismounted%20and%20dispersed.%20The%2025th%20Infantry%20Division%2C%20for%20example%2C%20has%20almost%202%2C200%20devices%2C%20while%20other%20divisions%20like%20the%204th%20ID%20have%20fewer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Army%20used%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-assessing-new-ai-enabled-battlefield-tech-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erecent%20exercise%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20assess%20the%20proper%20number%20of%20EUDs%20for%20different%20types%20of%20divisions%20and%20how%20far%20down%20the%20chain%20the%20devices%20should%20be%20distributed.%20Questions%20remain%20about%20who%20benefits%20the%20most%20from%20having%20one%2C%20with%20some%20Army%20officials%20noting%20that%20unit%20commanders%20should%20carry%20the%20devices%20to%20better%20facilitate%20movement%20and%20communication%20for%20their%20soldiers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20think%20it's%20informing%20us%20a%20little%20bit%20about%20who%20needs%20them%2C%20how%20far%20down%20do%20they%20go%2C%26quot%3B%20Lt.%20Gen.%20Michael%20McCurry%2C%20head%20of%20Futures%20and%20Concept%20Command%20within%20the%20Army's%20Transformation%20and%20Training%20Command%2C%20told%20reporters%20at%20the%20exercise.%20%26quot%3BIn%20different%20formation%20types%2C%20that%20might%20be%20different.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EArmy%20leaders%20see%20an%20advantage%20in%20technology%20that%20is%20already%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-tearing-down-tech-walls-weapons-talk-each-other-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eintuitive%20to%20soldiers%3C%2Fa%3E%20who%20use%20smartphones%20and%20tablets%20in%20their%20daily%20lives.%20Most%20younger%20troops%2C%20Maj.%20Gen.%20Patrick%20Ellis%2C%20commander%20of%20the%204th%20Infantry%20Division%2C%20said%2C%20are%20%26quot%3Bvery%20much%20digital%20natives%2C%20so%20if%20we%20can%20give%20them%20digital%20tools%20that%20make%20them%20better%2C%20that%20actually%20play%20to%20the%20strengths%20that%20they%20already%20have%2C%26quot%3B%20then%20it's%20%26quot%3Bsuper%2C%20super%20powerful.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGoing%20forward%2C%20EUDs%20could%20also%20incorporate%20other%20applications%2C%20such%20as%20tools%20for%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Emedical%20and%20logistics%20operations%20and%20expanded%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ephoto%20and%20video%20functions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsoldiers-are-using-chest-mounted-smartphones-for-mapping-communications-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787342224000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88a7ee1d1a1d028ba11de6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsoldiers-are-using-chest-mounted-smartphones-for-mapping-communications-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22At%20a%20recent%20exercise%2C%20US%20Army%20troops%20tested%20new%20systems%20for%20plot