0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-reviews-expertise-in-product-reviews%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELearn%20more%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Side-by-side%20images%20of%20two%20dogs%20wearing%20cooling%20vests%20outdoors%20include%20a%20small%20tan%20dog%20standing%20on%20a%20sandy%20beach%20and%20a%20large%20German%20Shepherd%20walking%20on%20grass.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88872f1d1a1d028ba11c56%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22960%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETwo%20vests%20stood%20out%20in%20our%20testing%3A%20The%20Canada%20Pooch%20Max%20Chill%20Cooling%20Vest%20is%20a%20great%20choice%20for%20most%20dogs%2C%20and%20the%20Ruffwear%20Swamp%20Cooler%20Cooling%20Vest%20is%20ideal%20for%20large%20dogs.%3Cp%3ELiz%20Coleman%3B%20Sarah%20Saril%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20can%20be%20hard%20to%20savor%20summer%20when%20your%20heat-sensitive%20dog%20wilts%20in%20temperatures%20a%20tick%20above%2070%20degrees.%20My%20adventure%20pup%2C%20Olive%2C%20loves%20the%20outdoors%2C%20but%20even%20moderately%20warm%20weather%20can%20have%20her%20cutting%20walks%20short%20and%20seeking%20shade.%20I%20hate%20seeing%20her%20uncomfortable%2C%20so%20I%20tapped%20the%20expertise%20of%20two%20veterinarians%20to%20find%20out%20whether%20a%20cooling%20vest%20might%20help%20extend%20our%20summer%20outings%20while%20keeping%20her%20safer%20and%20more%20comfortable.%20They%20explained%20that%20the%20best%20dog%20cooling%20vests%20can%20be%20a%20helpful%20tool%20for%20dogs%20prone%20to%20overheating%2C%20as%20long%20as%20they're%20used%20alongside%20other%20heat-safety%20measures.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBased%20on%20my%20experts'%20guidance%2C%20I%20chose%20five%20dog%20cooling%20vests%20to%20test%20with%20Olive%20in%20June%20and%20July%20as%20temperatures%20began%20to%20climb%20in%20Western%20New%20York%2C%20ranging%20from%20the%20mid-70s%20to%2090%20degrees%20Fahrenheit.%20All%20of%20the%20vests%20use%20water%20and%20evaporation%20to%20help%20keep%20dogs%20cool%2C%20which%20the%20veterinarians%20I%20spoke%20with%20say%20is%20the%20safest%20and%20easiest%20type%20of%20cooling%20vest%20to%20use.%20To%20see%20how%20this%20gear%20performs%20on%20bigger%20dogs%2C%20I%20also%20drew%20on%20testing%20from%20Insider%20Reviews%20editor%20Sarah%20Saril%2C%20who%20evaluated%20four%20vests%20with%20her%2070-pound%20German%20Shepherd.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2237b4b012-db3d-490a-9de1-ebdbb99fe619%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EA%20quick%20look%20at%20the%20best%20dog%20cooling%20vests%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20overall%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3De3d123cd4d22e86ba4612714a3413039411d92c24bec8857b85b5bf643041c92%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.petco.com%252Fproduct%252Fcanada-pooch-max-chill-cooling-dog-vest-blue-smallmedium-3987242%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECanada%20Pooch%20Max%20Chill%20Cooling%20Vest%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20made%20from%20lightweight%2C%20flexible%20fabric%20that's%20comfortable%20for%20dogs%20to%20wear%20and%20easy%20to%20stash%20in%20a%20travel%20tote.%20It%20provides%20full%20torso%20coverage%2C%20is%20simple%20to%20put%20on%20and%20take%20off%20for%20rewetting%2C%20and%20features%20an%20easy-to-adjust%20belly%20strap%20for%20a%20custom%20fit.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%20large%20dogs%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EOf%20the%20vests%20I%20tested%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3Dec4cd9185f8ca27fb9c4c3cc08fc2db5af5046e6231dbf61213ee65a0a3a352b%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fruffwear-swamp-cooler-dog-vest%252Fdp%252F1762030%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERuffwear%20Swamp%20Cooler%20Cooling%20Vest%3C%2Fa%3E%20accommodates%20the%20largest%20of%20dogs%20and%20feels%20durable%20enough%20to%20withstand%20their%20big%20adventures.%20While%20it's%20slightly%20bulkier%20than%20the%20other%20vests%2C%20it%20provides%20effective%20cooling%20with%20breathable%20mesh%20layers%2C%20and%20its%20light-colored%20fabric%20can%20help%20reduce%20heat%20absorption%20from%20the%20sun.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EKeep%20in%20mind%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ECooling%20vests%20should%20always%20be%20used%20alongside%20other%20heat-safety%20practices%2C%20such%20as%20staying%20indoors%20during%20the%20hottest%20part%20of%20the%20day%20and%20ensuring%20access%20to%20water%20and%20shade%2C%20says%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bayshorevethospital.com%2Fabout-us-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20Tim%20Hunt%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20veterinarian%20and%20founder%20of%20Bayshore%20Veterinary%20Hospital.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fstitchesvet.com%2Fveterinarian-long-beach-ca%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20Courtney%20Campbell%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20board-certified%20veterinary%20surgeon%20at%20Stitches%20Veterinary%20Surgery%2C%20recommends%20monitoring%20dogs%20in%20warm%20weather%20and%20watching%20for%20signs%20of%20overheating%2C%20such%20as%20excessive%20panting%2C%20slowing%20down%2C%20seeking%20shade%2C%20bright%20red%20or%20pale%20gums%2C%20vomiting%2C%20diarrhea%2C%20weakness%2C%20wobbliness%2C%20or%20collapse.%20%26quot%3BHeatstroke%20is%20much%20easier%20to%20prevent%20than%20it%20is%20to%20treat%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20says.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22896a34d7-fb4b-48ac-b58a-770d23ae3182%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow%20we%20tested%20dog%20cooling%20vests%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20dog%20cooling%20vest%20is%20soaked%20under%20a%20faucet%2C%20while%20an%20infrared%20thermometer%20measures%20a%20dog's%20back%20during%20outdoor%20testing.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8898fc4569a4ec219f900c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20wet%20and%20rewet%20every%20vest%20I%20tested%20and%20measured%20the%20surface%20temperature%20of%20my%20dog's%20back%20after%20she%20wore%20each%20vest.%3Cp%3ELiz%20Coleman%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dog%2C%20Olive%2C%20loves%20being%20outside%2C%20but%20she's%20not%20a%20fan%20of%20the%20heat.%20I%20wanted%20to%20find%20the%20best%20dog%20cooling%20vests%20to%20offer%20her%20some%20relief%2C%20so%20I%20asked%20two%20veterinarians%20what%20to%20look%20for.%20Based%20on%20their%20input%2C%20I%20developed%20a%20series%20of%20tests%20to%20evaluate%20the%20performance%20of%20five%20cooling%20vests%20across%20several%20key%20categories.%20Fellow%20Reviews%20reporter%20Sarah%20Saril%20also%20tested%20four%20of%20the%20five%20vests%20with%20her%2070-pound%20German%20Shepherd%2C%20Davey.%20Saril%20was%20unable%20to%20test%20one%20of%20our%20contenders%2C%20the%20Kurgo%20Core%20Cooling%20Vest%2C%20because%20it%20was%20out%20of%20stock%20in%20Davey's%20size%20at%20the%20time%20of%20testing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20a%20rundown%20of%20how%20we%20evaluated%20the%20cooling%20vests%20to%20land%20on%20my%20top%20two%20picks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EFit%20and%20adjustability%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EA%20good%20fit%20allows%20dogs%20to%20move%20around%20comfortably%20while%20ensuring%20the%20vest%20maintains%20contact%20with%20the%20body.%20I%20put%20each%20vest%20on%20Olive%20to%20see%20whether%20it%20fit%20as%20expected%20and%20matched%20the%20manufacturer's%20size%20chart.%20I%20also%20considered%20the%20range%20of%20available%20sizes%20and%20how%20easy%20each%20vest%20was%20to%20adjust.%20While%20playing%20outdoors%2C%20Saril%20and%20I%20observed%20whether%20the%20vests%20stayed%20in%20place%20or%20shifted%20as%20our%20dogs%20moved.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EComfort%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20cooling%20vests%20in%20this%20guide%20must%20be%20wet%20with%20water%20before%20use%2C%20but%20a%20vest%20that%20becomes%20too%20heavy%20will%20be%20uncomfortable.%20I%20weighed%20each%20vest%20before%20and%20after%20soaking%2C%20giving%20preference%20to%20lighter%20options.%20We%20also%20watched%20how%20our%20dogs%20moved%20while%20wearing%20the%20vests%20and%20noted%20how%20comfortable%20they%20appeared.%20After%20each%20outing%2C%20we%20checked%20for%20signs%20of%20chafing%20or%20irritation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESurface%20temperature%20change%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EI%20used%20an%20infrared%20thermometer%20to%20measure%20how%20much%20each%20vest%20reduced%20the%20surface%20temperature%20of%20Olive's%20back%20and%20chest%20after%20she%20had%20worn%20it%20for%20five%20minutes.%20Of%20course%2C%20this%20test%20was%20imperfect%2C%20since%20it%20only%20measured%20Olive's%20surface%20temperature%20and%20not%20her%20internal%20core%20temperature.%20Nevertheless%2C%20it%20provided%20valuable%20information%20about%20how%20well%20each%20vest%20worked%20on%20the%20surface%20areas%20it%20covered.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEase%20of%20rewetting%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThese%20cooling%20vests%20rely%20on%20evaporation%20to%20work.%20This%20means%20that%20as%20they%20dry%2C%20they%20become%20less%20effective%20and%20need%20to%20be%20re-soaked.%20A%20vest%20that%20is%20easy%20to%20remove%20quickly%20and%20rewet%20is%20more%20practical.%20We%20timed%20how%20long%20it%20took%20to%20remove%20each%20damp%20vest%2C%20soak%20it%2C%20wring%20it%20out%2C%20and%20put%20it%20back%20on%20our%20dogs.%20We%20also%20noted%20vests%20with%20tricky%20designs%2C%20concealed%20buckles%2C%20or%20bulky%20materials%20that%20made%20the%20process%20more%20difficult.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDurability%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Since%20they're%20outdoor%20accessories%2C%20cooling%20vests%20should%20withstand%20contact%20with%20brush%2C%20rocks%2C%20and%20rugged%20terrain.%20Before%20use%2C%20I%20inspected%20each%20vest%20for%20manufacturing%20defects%2C%20like%20weak%20buckles%20or%20loose%20stitching.%20Then%20I%20dragged%20a%20dinner%20fork%20across%20the%20fabric%2030%20times%2C%20tugged%20on%20any%20straps%2C%20and%20ran%20zippers%20back%20and%20forth%20to%20assess%20durability.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEase%20of%20cleaning%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EOutdoor%20gear%20is%20bound%20to%20get%20dirty%2C%20and%20a%20wet%20vest%2C%20in%20particular%2C%20will%20pick%20up%20dirt%20and%20dust.%20A%20vest%20that's%20hard%20to%20clean%20isn't%20a%20practical%20option.%20For%20this%20test%2C%20I%20smeared%20dirt%20onto%20the%20vests%20while%20they%20were%20wet%20and%20left%20them%20to%20dry%20overnight.%20The%20next%20morning%2C%20I%20tried%20spot%20cleaning%20them%2C%20noting%20whether%20the%20dirt%20came%20off%20easily.%20Then%2C%20I%20washed%20each%20vest%20according%20to%20the%20manufacturer's%20directions%2C%20noting%20the%20ease%20or%20difficulty%20of%20the%20process%2C%20whether%20any%20stains%20remained%2C%20and%20how%20well%20the%20material%20held%20up%20after%20washing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22aa87d7c3-b46f-48a6-9792-b68977c58509%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20overall%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EMost%20dogs%2C%20including%20small%20pups%20and%20dogs%20who%20spend%20long%20periods%20outdoors%20and%20need%20a%20vest%20that's%20easy%20to%20put%20on%20and%20quick%20to%20re-wet%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EYour%20dog%20is%20sensitive%20to%20straps%20around%20their%20legs%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EOf%20the%20five%20vests%20I%20tested%2C%20the%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3De3d123cd4d22e86ba4612714a3413039411d92c24bec8857b85b5bf643041c92%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.petco.com%252Fproduct%252Fcanada-pooch-max-chill-cooling-dog-vest-blue-smallmedium-3987242%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECanada%20Pooch%20vest%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%20provided%20the%20most%20coverage%2C%20extending%20down%20my%20dog's%20back%20to%20her%20tail%20and%20covering%20most%20of%20her%20chest.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20coverage%20is%20important%20because%20of%20how%20evaporative%20cooling%20vests%20work.%20My%20experts%20explain%20that%20the%20vests%20are%20soaked%20in%20water%2C%20and%20as%20the%20water%20evaporates%2C%20it%20pulls%20heat%20away%20from%20the%20dog's%20body.%20%26quot%3BA%20good%20vest%20should%20make%20contact%20with%20the%20dog's%20core%2C%20particularly%20the%20chest%20and%20abdomen%2C%20where%20heat%20exchange%20is%20most%20effective%2C%26quot%3B%20Hunt%20says.%20A%20good%20fit%20plays%20a%20role%20here%2C%20too%2C%20by%20ensuring%20the%20vest%20is%20snug%20enough%20to%20maintain%20contact%20with%20the%20dog's%20body.%20The%20Canada%20Pooch%20fit%20as%20expected%2C%20and%20the%20belly%20strap%20was%20easy%20to%20adjust%20around%20Olive's%20torso.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20Canada%20Pooch%20also%20features%20lightweight%20fabric%20that%20doesn't%20become%20overly%20heavy%20or%20bulky%20when%20wet%20%E2%80%94%20an%20important%20consideration%20for%20all%20dogs%2C%20but%20especially%20those%20who%20don't%20like%20wearing%20apparel.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20It's%20made%20with%20a%20pliable%20jersey%20material%20that%20drapes%20over%20the%20dog's%20body%20and%20is%20soft%20against%20their%20skin.%20The%20material's%20flexibility%20makes%20it%20easy%20to%20wring%20out%20excess%20water.%20It%20also%20makes%20it%20easy%20to%20fold%20and%20pack%20away%20in%20your%20beach%20bag%20or%20hiking%20pack.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20vest%20is%20intuitive%20and%20easy%20to%20put%20on%2C%20a%20feature%20my%20experts%20say%20is%20helpful%20for%20longer%20outings%20when%20you'll%20need%20to%20remove%20and%20replace%20it%20for%20rewetting.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThere's%20only%20one%20buckle%20you'll%20need%20to%20snap%2C%20so%20you%20can%20get%20it%20back%20on%20your%20dog%20quickly.%20Just%20note%20that%20you'll%20need%20to%20slip%20it%20over%20your%20dog's%20head%2C%20and%20some%20dogs%20find%20this%20process%20uncomfortable%20or%20scary.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20Canada%20Pooch%20also%20performed%20the%20best%20in%20our%20evaluation%20for%20temperature%20change.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWhile%20this%20test%20was%20imperfect%20because%20it%20didn't%20measure%20our%20dog's%20core%20temperature%2C%20it%20still%20provided%20insight%20into%20each%20vest's%20ability%20to%20cool%20down%20the%20surface%20of%20their%20fur.%20For%20this%20test%2C%20I%20used%20an%20infrared%20thermometer%20to%20measure%20Olive's%20temperature%20on%20her%20back%20and%20chest%20after%20she%20had%20been%20sitting%20in%20the%20sun%20for%2010%20minutes.%20Then%20I%20rechecked%20her%20temperature%20after%20she%20had%20worn%20a%20vest%20for%205%20minutes.%20The%20Canada%20Pooch%20showed%20the%20most%20dramatic%20change%2C%20with%20the%20fur%20on%20her%20back%20dropping%20about%2030%20degrees%20Fahrenheit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Side-by-side%20images%20of%20a%20small%20tan%20dog%20wearing%20a%20blue%20cooling%20vest%20outdoors%20include%20the%20dog%20standing%20on%20a%20sandy%20beach%20and%20the%20dog%20sitting%20on%20grass.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8879bc8a99fa493d60ede0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20Canada%20Pooch%20vest%20features%20excellent%20coverage%20and%20a%20lightweight%2C%20comfortable%20fit.%3Cp%3ELiz%20Coleman%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20was%20pleased%20to%20see%20the%20vest%20protects%20against%20harmful%20UV%20rays%20with%20a%20UPF%2050%2B%20rated%20outer%20layer.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20This%20means%20it%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sciencedirect.com%2Fscience%2Farticle%2Fpii%2FS2405844024160586%23sec4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eblocks%2098%25%20of%20UV%20rays%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20making%20it%20a%20good%20protective%20measure%20for%20vulnerable%20pets%2C%20including%20dogs%20with%20light%20skin%2C%20hairless%20dogs%2C%20and%20those%20with%20thin%20coats.%20The%20brand%20informed%20me%20that%20this%20vest%20is%20made%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcoolcore.com%2Fen-us%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECoolcore%20Biomimetic%20Fiber%3C%2Fa%3E%20fabric.%20This%20material%20is%20tightly%20woven%20with%20very%20small%20gaps%20between%20the%20threads%2C%20which%20helps%20prevent%20UV%20rays%20from%20passing%20through.%20Additionally%2C%20the%20vest%20is%20primarily%20made%20of%20polyester%2C%20which%20naturally%20reflects%20and%20blocks%20UV%20rays.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20vest%20isn't%20perfect%2C%20though.%20%3Cstrong%3EOne%20potential%20drawback%20of%20the%20design%20is%20the%20back%20leg%20stirrups%20that%20keep%20it%20in%20place.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWhile%20Olive%20and%20Davey%20didn't%20mind%20them%2C%20some%20dogs%20might%20find%20these%20elastic%20straps%20uncomfortable.%20Unfortunately%2C%20the%20vest%20shifted%20without%20them%20secured%20around%20Olive's%20legs.%20Even%20if%20the%20vest%20had%20stayed%20in%20place%2C%20there's%20the%20issue%20of%20two%20dangling%20loops%20that%20could%20easily%20become%20caught%20on%20brush%20or%20branches.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%225c0b8101-a2eb-4350-b09b-ede248e0bb55%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%20large%20dogs%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EBigger%20dogs%20or%20active%20dogs%20who%20are%20hard%20on%20their%20gear%20and%20need%20a%20more%20durable%20vest.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EYour%20dog%20is%20very%20petite%20or%20rambunctious%2C%20as%20the%20hidden%20buckles%20can%20make%20it%20harder%20to%20put%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3Dec4cd9185f8ca27fb9c4c3cc08fc2db5af5046e6231dbf61213ee65a0a3a352b%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fruffwear-swamp-cooler-dog-vest%252Fdp%252F1762030%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ERuffwear%20Swamp%20Cooler%20Vest%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%20stands%20out%20with%20its%20triple-layered%20design%2C%20which%20combines%20a%20wicking%20outer%20layer%20that%20reflects%20heat%20and%20an%20absorbent%20middle%20layer%20that%20stores%20water.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20This%20makes%20the%20Ruffwear%20a%20bit%20bulkier%20and%20heavier%20than%20the%20other%20vests%20we%20tested%2C%20but%20the%20mesh%20fabric%20is%20breathable%20and%20maximizes%20airflow%2C%20which%20Campbell%20says%20is%20necessary%20for%20evaporative%20cooling%20to%20work.%20Tester%20dog%20Davey%2C%20a%2070-pound%20German%20Shepherd%2C%20was%20unbothered%20by%20the%20heavier%20material%2C%20but%20the%20added%20heft%20might%20be%20something%20to%20consider%20if%20your%20dog%20is%20tiny%20or%20strongly%20dislikes%20wearing%20gear.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EOf%20the%20five%20vests%20we%20tested%2C%20the%20Ruffwear%20accommodates%20the%20largest%20chest%20girth%2C%20so%20it%20should%20fit%20dogs%20with%20a%20larger%20chest.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EIt%20also%20has%20multiple%20points%20of%20adjustment.%20The%20nylon%20straps%20glided%20smoothly%20through%20the%20buckles%2C%20making%20it%20easy%20to%20get%20the%20right%20fit.%20The%20Large%20size%20fit%20Davey%20well%20and%20made%20contact%20with%20her%20body.%20For%20the%20most%20part%2C%20the%20vest%20stayed%20in%20place%20as%20Davey%20moved%20around%2C%20but%20Saril%20noted%20that%20the%20vest's%20rigid%20style%20made%20it%20less%20flexible%20when%20Davey%20curled%20up.%20Nevertheless%2C%20the%20Ruffwear%20always%20shifted%20back%20into%20place%20when%20Davey%20returned%20to%20a%20relaxed%20standing%20position.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20vest%20seemed%20more%20durable%20than%20the%20Canada%20Pooch%2C%20thanks%20to%20its%20thicker%20fabric%20and%20sturdy%20stitching.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20is%20a%20hallmark%20of%20the%20Ruffwear%20brand%2C%20which%20sends%20materials%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fruffwear.com%2Fblogs%2Fexplored%2Fhow-we-test-our-gear%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ethird-party%20lab%20testing%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20assess%20things%20like%20abrasion%20and%20tear%20resistance.%20The%20Ruffwear%20vest%20sustained%20no%20damage%20during%20my%20durability%20tests%20and%20came%20out%20of%20the%20washing%20machine%20perfectly%20intact.I%20imagine%20it%20would%20hold%20up%20well%20on%20treks%20through%20dense%20brush%20and%20rugged%20terrain.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Side-by-side%20images%20of%20a%20German%20Shepherd%20dog%20wearing%20a%20light%20gray%20and%20mint%20green%20cooling%20vest%20while%20standing%20and%20walking%20on%20grass.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8895504569a4ec219f8f99%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Ruffwear%20Swamp%20Cooler%20Vest%20can%20fit%20chests%20up%20to%2042%20inches%20and%20was%20an%20excellent%20option%20for%20our%2070-pound%20German%20Shepherd%20tester.%3Cp%3ESarah%20Saril%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20Ruffwear%20vest%20also%20features%20concealed%20side%20release%20buckles%20sandwiched%20between%20fabric%20layers%2C%20which%20help%20prevent%20chafing%20%E2%80%94%20a%20problem%20that%20Campbell%20says%20can%20be%20worsened%20when%20a%20dog%20is%20wet.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Saril%20didn't%20have%20trouble%20securing%20these%20on%20Davey%20because%20she's%20calm%2C%20but%20for%20folks%20with%20more%20rambunctious%2070-pounders%2C%20the%20hidden%20buckles%20could%20be%20difficult%20to%20reach%20and%20adjust.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EOn%20the%20downside%2C%20Ruffwear's%20fabric%20is%20rather%20stiff.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20rigidity%20might%20make%20it%20uncomfortable%20for%20some%20dogs%2C%20though%20it%20did%20not%20inhibit%20Davey.%20It%20also%20means%20it%20takes%20up%20more%20space%20in%20a%20travel%20pack%20compared%20to%20the%20more%20compact%20Canada%20Pooch.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EOne%20issue%20I%20ran%20into%20while%20playing%20with%20Olive%20on%20a%20beachy%20shoreline%20was%20that%20chunks%20of%20sand%20and%20dirt%20became%20lodged%20in%20the%20layers%20of%20mesh.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EI%20was%20able%20to%20shake%20most%20of%20these%20out%20after%20our%20excursion%2C%20but%20there%20were%20still%20particles%20stuck%20in%20the%20fabric%20that%20only%20came%20out%20after%20thorough%20rinsing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a3bb43e7-6fb4-4bcc-b2c9-6045c84afd9e%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20else%20we%20tested%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20small%20tan%20dog%20models%20three%20different%20cooling%20vests%20while%20sitting%20on%20the%20grass%20outdoors.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88822b8a99fa493d60ee4a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20tested%20three%20other%20options%20from%20Kurgo%2C%20Ruffwear%2C%20and%20Hurtta.%3Cp%3ELiz%20Coleman%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3D9ab28b5b8dc9482f2f36d6a90e48998d8b4c82979999559cf8e8c22c521b6f20%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fkurgo-core-cooling-dog-vest%252Fdp%252F143286%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EKurgo%20Core%20Cooling%20Vest%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20Similar%20in%20design%20to%20our%20picks%20above%2C%20the%20Kurgo%20could%20be%20a%20good%20choice%20for%20some%20dogs%2C%20including%20more%20active%20pups.%20Of%20the%20five%20tested%2C%20it%20was%20the%20lightest%20in%20weight%2C%20even%20when%20wet.%20The%20polyethylene%20vinyl%20acetate%20(PEVA)%20material%20is%20flexible%2C%20and%20the%20slightly%20narrower%20chest%20panel%20allows%20for%20full%2C%20unrestricted%20freedom%20of%20movement.%20There%20are%20also%20fabric%20loops%20on%20both%20sides%20of%20the%20vest%20through%20which%20you%20can%20thread%20the%20buckled%20belly%20straps.%20This%20prevents%20the%20belly%20straps%20from%20sliding%20forward%20and%20minimizes%20the%20risk%20of%20chafing.%20Finally%2C%20the%20Kurgo%20was%20easy%20to%20clean%2C%20and%20dirt%20didn't%20get%20trapped%20in%20the%20mesh%20the%20way%20it%20did%20with%20the%20Ruffwear.%20Unfortunately%2C%20it%20doesn't%20offer%20UPF%20protection%2C%20and%20it%20only%20comes%20in%20four%20sizes%2C%20which%20go%20in%20and%20out%20of%20stock.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3Dc4e0b72714f3371938e16a80492e96f39e4e451962732ebd510a5f878001dc0d%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fruffwear-swamp-cooler-front-clip-dog%252Fdp%252F4321422%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ERuffwear%20Swamp%20Cooler%20Harness%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ESince%20a%20cooling%20vest%20needs%20to%20make%20contact%20with%20the%20body%20to%20be%20effective%2C%20it%20won't%20work%20as%20well%20when%20worn%20over%20a%20harness.%20If%20you%20want%20to%20use%20cooling%20apparel%20on%20walks%20or%20in%20scenarios%20where%20your%20dog%20needs%20to%20be%20leashed%2C%20Ruffwear's%20cooling%20harness%20makes%20the%20most%20sense.%20Though%20it%20offers%20less%20coverage%20than%20the%20brand's%20vest%2C%20it%20still%20covers%20a%20fair%20amount%20of%20Olive's%20torso.%20It%20has%20six%20points%20of%20adjustment%2C%20but%20with%20four%20buckles%2C%20it%20can%20be%20trickier%20to%20take%20off%20and%20put%20back%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126950650za-20%26h%3D07d1d1ec3f60b1eb9d13a57f7042d3128e5698a98edfc751dab9d37dab0d6f30%26postID%3D6a885ea95bbe9e970671a999%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-cooling-vests%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fhurtta-cooling-dog-wrap%252Fdp%252F346301%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EHurtta%20Cooling%20Wrap%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20I%20was%20the%20least%20impressed%20by%20this%20vest.%20The%20sizing%20was%20off%2C%20and%20the%20wrap%20design%20made%20it%20confusing%20to%20put%20on.%20I%20found%20the%20buckle%20fiddly%2C%20and%20it%20offered%20the%20least%20coverage.%20Saril%20also%20noted%20the%20soft%20fabric%20could%20bunch%20up%20with%20very%20active%20wearers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2208ad6948-de7e-4d67-878c-3a995a4a308a%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20to%20look%20for%20in%20a%20dog%20cooling%20vest%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20find%20the%20best%20dog%20cooling%20vest%20for%20your%20pup%2C%20Hunt%20says%20to%20prioritize%20fit%20and%20coverage.%20That%20means%20looking%20for%20a%20vest%20that's%20adjustable%20and%20covers%20a%20good%20portion%20of%20the%20dog's%20back%20and%20chest.%20Here's%20what%20else%20my%20experts%20recommend%20focusing%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECooling%20mechanism%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EMost%20dog%20cooling%20vests%20rely%20on%20evaporation%2C%20which%20Hunt%20says%20is%20the%20most%20practical%20for%20regular%20use.%20Some%20vests%20use%20ice%20or%20frozen%20gel%20inserts%2C%20which%20Campbell%20advises%20against%20because%20they%20can%20become%20too%20heavy%20or%20too%20cold%20against%20the%20skin.%20There%20are%20also%20vests%20made%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC9494994%2F%23animals-12-02347-f003%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ephase%20change%20materials%3C%2Fa%3E%20(PCMs)%2C%20such%20as%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC4809117%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eparaffin-based%20compounds%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sciencedirect.com%2Ftopics%2Fengineering%2Fsalt-hydrate%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esalt%20hydrates%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20absorb%20heat%20from%20the%20dog's%20body%20as%20they%20transition%20from%20a%20solid%20to%20a%20liquid%20state.%20PCMs%20are%20similar%20to%20ice%20packs%20and%20must%20be%20frozen%2C%20so%20they%20require%20some%20pre-planning.%20However%2C%20unlike%20ice%2C%20they%20stay%20dry%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2F23160652%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emelt%20at%20warmer%20temperatures%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20provide%20more%20comfortable%20cooling.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EGood%20chest%20and%20back%20coverage%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ECampbell%20says%20cooling%20vests%20should%20cover%20as%20much%20surface%20area%20of%20a%20dog's%20body%20as%20possible%20to%20maximize%20heat%20exchange.%20Look%20for%20a%20vest%20that%20covers%20the%20dog's%20back%2C%20chest%2C%20and%20abdomen.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EFit%20and%20adjustability%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ESince%20the%20vest%20needs%20to%20make%20contact%20with%20the%20dog's%20body%20to%20work%2C%20my%20experts%20recommend%20choosing%20one%20that's%20adjustable.%20%26quot%3BIt%20should%20be%20snug%20enough%20to%20stay%20in%20place%20but%20not%20restrict%20shoulder%20movement%2C%20chest%20expansion%2C%20or%20breathing%2C%26quot%3B%20Campbell%20says.%20Look%20for%20adjustable%20buckles%20and%20measure%20your%20dog%20carefully%20before%20ordering.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EComfortable%20materials%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Hunt%20recommends%20looking%20for%20lightweight%2C%20breathable%20fabrics%2C%20like%20polyester%20mesh%2C%20that%20retain%20water%20without%20becoming%20heavy%20or%20bulky.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EReflective%20or%20light-colored%20outer%20fabric%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EReflective%20accents%20make%20your%20dog%20more%20visible.%20Campbell%20says%20reflective%20or%20light-colored%20material%20can%20also%20reduce%20radiant%20heat%20from%20the%20sun.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESun%20protection%20(UPF)%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Farticles%2FPMC9414157%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESun-protective%20clothing%3C%2Fa%3E%20offers%20an%20added%20layer%20of%20protection%20for%20vulnerable%20dogs%2C%20including%20light-skinned%2C%20thin-coated%2C%20and%20hairless%20dogs.%20Typically%2C%20this%20type%20of%20apparel%20is%20made%20with%20tightly%20woven%20fibers%20that%20physically%20block%20harmful%20UV%20rays.%20Additionally%2C%20these%20garments%20often%20incorporate%20brightly%20colored%20dyes%20to%20reflect%20UV%20rays.%20Look%20for%20vests%20with%20a%20UPF%2050%2B%20rating%2C%20which%20blocks%2098%25%20of%20UV%20rays.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2234b2d17c-d48c-4117-ab38-c3938381c05c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EDog%20cooling%20vest%20FAQs%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20is%20the%20best%20way%20to%20keep%20a%20dog%20cool%20in%20the%20summer%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EKeeping%20a%20dog%20cool%20in%20summer%20involves%20multiple%20tools%20and%20strategies.%20Along%20with%20a%20cooling%20vest%2C%20my%20experts%20recommend%20keeping%20outings%20shorter%2C%20avoiding%20peak%20temperatures%2C%2C%20limiting%20exercise%20in%20the%20heat%2C%20and%20offering%20water%20and%20shade.%20You%20can%20also%20offer%20your%20dog%20relief%20with%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-cooling-mats-pads-for-dogs%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecooling%20mat%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20a%20shallow%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-dog-pools%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewading%20pool%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Finally%2C%20Campbell%20says%20it's%20important%20to%20know%20your%20dog's%20individual%20risk%20factors%20for%20overheating%2C%20such%20as%20age%20(i.e.%2C%20older%20dogs%20and%20puppies)%20or%20anatomy%20(i.e.%2C%20flat-faced%20breeds%20or%20overweight%20dogs).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EDo%20vets%20recommend%20cooling%20vests%20for%20dogs%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20Campbell%20recommends%20them%20for%20certain%20dogs%20and%20certain%20situations.%20%26quot%3BA%20cooling%20vest%20can%20be%20useful%20for%20a%20healthy%20dog%20on%20a%20warm-weather%20walk%2C%20during%20a%20short%20outdoor%20outing%2C%20while%20waiting%20in%20shade%20at%20an%20event%2C%20or%20for%20dogs%20who%20tend%20to%20warm%20up%20quickly%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20says.%20My%20experts%20also%20say%20cooling%20vests%20can%20be%20a%20helpful%20tool%20for%20dogs%20at%20higher%20risk%20of%20overheating%2C%20such%20as%20brachycephalic%20breeds%2C%20senior%20dogs%2C%20overweight%20dogs%2C%20dark-coated%20dogs%2C%20highly%20active%20working%20or%20sporting%20dogs%2C%20or%20dogs%20who%20are%20acclimating%20to%20warmer%20weather.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20cooling%20vests%20can%20provide%20an%20added%20layer%20of%20protection%20during%20outdoor%20activity%2C%20Hunt%20and%20Campbell%20say%20they%20are%20not%20a%20substitute%20for%20common%20sense%20heat%20management.%20Pet%20parents%20should%20limit%20outdoor%20time%20during%20the%20hottest%20parts%20of%20the%20day%20and%20make%20sure%20their%20dog%20always%20has%20access%20to%20water%20and%20shade.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20are%20the%20disadvantages%20of%20a%20cooling%20vest%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20main%20disadvantage%20of%20a%20cooling%20vest%20is%20that%20it%20can%20create%20a%20false%20sense%20of%20security.%20%26quot%3BA%20cooling%20vest%20can%20make%20pet%20parents%20think%2C%20'My%20dog%20is%20protected%2C%20so%20we%20can%20stay%20out%20longer.'%20That%20is%20when%20we%20get%20into%20trouble%2C%26quot%3B%20Campbell%20says.%20As%20he%20puts%20it%3A%20Cooling%20vests%20can%20be%20helpful%2C%20but%20they%20are%20not%20magic%20armor%20against%20heatstroke.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEvaporative%20cooling%20vests%20are%20also%20less%20effective%20in%20humid%20weather.%20%26quot%3BIn%20high%20humidity%2C%20the%20air%20is%20already%20saturated%20with%20moisture%2C%20so%20evaporation%20slows%20down%2C%20making%20the%20vest%20less%20effective%2C%26quot%3B%20Hunt%20says.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%20My%20experts%20say%20other%20disadvantages%20include%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EEvaporative%20vests%20need%20to%20be%20re-wetted%20to%20remain%20effective%2C%20which%20can%20be%20inconvenient%20or%20impossible%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EPotential%20for%20rubbing%20or%20skin%20irritation%20if%20the%20fit%20is%20off%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAdded%20weight%20when%20wet%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESome%20dogs%20dislike%20wearing%20gear%20such%20as%20cooling%20vests%20and%20coats%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch3%3EHow%20hot%20is%20too%20hot%20for%20a%20dog%20to%20be%20outside%20or%20exercise%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EHunt%20follows%20the%20heat-plus-humidity%20rule.%20To%20figure%20out%20if%20it's%20too%20hot%20for%20your%20dog%2C%20he%20says%20to%20add%20the%20temperature%20in%20degrees%20Fahrenheit%20to%20the%20humidity%20percentage%2C%20then%20follow%20these%20guidelines%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EUnder%20130%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20is%20generally%20safe%20for%20normal%20exercise%20and%20walks.%20Check%20the%20pavement%20heat%20with%20your%20hand%20and%20offer%20plenty%20of%20water.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3E130%20to%20149%20(Caution%20Zone)%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ELower%20exercise%20intensity%2C%20shorten%20walk%20times%2C%20and%20take%20frequent%20water%20breaks%20in%20the%20shade.%20Watch%20your%20dog%20for%20heavy%20panting%20or%20other%20signs%20of%20overheating%20like%20drooling%2C%20red%20gums%2C%20or%20lethargy.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3E150%20and%20Above%20(Danger%20Zone)%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ECancel%20heavy%20outdoor%20exercise%2C%20including%20running%20and%20long%20walks.%20Limit%20outdoor%20activity%20to%20quick%20bathroom%20breaks%20only.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EKeep%20in%20mind%2C%20heat%20tolerance%20will%20vary%20based%20on%20a%20dog's%20breed%20and%20other%20risk%20factors.%20Hunt%20advises%20lowering%20your%20safety%20threshold%20by%2010%20to%2020%20points%20with%20senior%20dogs%2C%20puppies%2C%20overweight%20dogs%2C%20brachycephalic%20breeds%2C%20thick-coated%20or%20double-coated%20breeds%2C%20and%20dogs%20with%20health%20issues.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20are%20the%20signs%20of%20overheating%20in%20dogs%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECampbell%20says%20to%20watch%20for%20excessive%20panting%2C%20slower%20movement%2C%20seeking%20shade%2C%20bright%20red%20or%20pale%20gums%2C%20vomiting%2C%20diarrhea%2C%20weakness%2C%20wobbliness%2C%20or%20collapse.%20%26quot%3BBe%20careful%20of%20a%20dog%20who%20stops%20panting%2C%20no%20longer%20wants%20to%20drink%20water%2C%20or%20suddenly%20stops%20playing%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20says%2C%20as%20these%20can%20be%20signs%20of%20early%20heat%20distress.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vet.cornell.edu%2Fdepartments-centers-and-institutes%2Friney-canine-health-center%2Fcanine-health-information%2Fheatstroke-medical-emergency%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EHeatstroke%20is%20a%20medical%20emergency%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20requires%20veterinary%20intervention.%20If%