rnational%20Catholic%20Legislators%20Network's%20annual%20conference.%3Cp%3EVatican%20Pool%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EPope%20Leo%20XIV%20addressed%20Christian%20lawmakers%20at%20a%20conference%20in%20Rome%20on%20Friday.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20expressed%20concern%20over%20how%20AI%20could%20disrupt%20families%20and%20cause%20%26quot%3Beconomic%20colonialism.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAI%20has%20remained%20a%20focal%20point%20for%20Pope%20Leo%20XIV%20throughout%20his%20papacy.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpope-leo-xiv-ai-artificial-intelligence-speech-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EPope%20Leo%20XIV%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20a%20simple%20request%20for%20lawmakers%20tasked%20with%20shaping%20AI%20policy%3A%20put%20humans%20first.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20pontiff%20encouraged%20them%20to%20implement%20laws%20that%20uplift%20their%20constituents%20at%20the%20International%20Catholic%20Legislators%20Network's%20annual%20conference%20in%20Rome%20on%20Friday.%20During%20his%20speech%2C%20Pope%20Leo%20cautioned%20lawmakers%20that%20putting%20tech%20over%20people%20could%20have%20dire%20consequences.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAt%20the%20same%20time%2C%20the%20rapid%20development%20of%20artificial%20intelligence%20risks%20creating%20new%20forms%20of%20technological%20dependence%2C%20with%20poorer%20nations%20increasingly%20reliant%20on%20wealthier%20ones%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BWe%20must%20remain%20vigilant%20in%20this%20regard%2C%20lest%20innovation%20become%20another%20vehicle%20for%20ideological%20or%20economic%20colonialism.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20pope%20told%20lawmakers%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fx-twitter-algorithm-details-open-source-elon-musk-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esocial%20media%20algorithms%3C%2Fa%3E%20already%20constitute%20a%20form%20of%20domination.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fplatform.x.com%2Fwidgets.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cblockquote%20class%3D%5C%22twitter-tweet%5C%22%3E%3Cp%20lang%3D%5C%22en%5C%22%20dir%3D%5C%22ltr%5C%22%3EThe%20world%20does%20not%20need%20an%20artificial%20intelligence%20that%20diminishes%20humanity%3B%20rather%2C%20it%20needs%20human%20intelligence%20enlightened%20by%20wisdom%2C%20political%20authority%20guided%20by%20conscience%20and%20technological%20innovation%20directed%20by%20charity.%20Only%20then%20will%20artificial%20intelligence%20become%20not%20a%E2%80%A6%3C%2Fp%3E%E2%80%94%20Pope%20Leo%20XIV%20(%40Pontifex)%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FPontifex%2Fstatus%2F2090763999075868746%3Fref_src%3Dtwsrc%255Etfw%5C%22%3EAugust%2021%2C%202026%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSadly%2C%20we%20are%20presented%20with%20a%20subtle%20form%20of%20domination%20when%20algorithms%20decide%20who%20is%20seen%2C%20who%20remains%20invisible%2C%20when%20digital%20platforms%20shape%20public%20discourse%20without%20accountability%2C%20and%20when%20the%20dignity%20of%20workers%20is%20subordinated%20to%20the%20optimization%20of%20systems%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPope%20Leo%20also%20expressed%20concern%20that%20AI%20could%20undermine%20families%20and%20their%20place%20in%20society.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFor%20it%20is%20within%20the%20family%20that%20we%20first%20learn%20trust%20before%20calculation%2C%20generosity%20before%20competition%2C%20dialogue%20before%20division%2C%20and%20love%20before%20power%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BArtificial%20intelligence%20must%20never%20be%20allowed%20to%20erode%20this%20primary%20cell%20of%20society%20%E2%80%94%20whether%20by%20reducing%20persons%20and%20relationships%20to%20data%20and%20simulations%2C%20by%20flooding%20young%20minds%20with%20content%20that%20distorts%20desire%2C%20or%20by%20economic%20models%20that%20make%20family%20life%20economically%20precarious.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20asked%20that%20the%20lawmakers%20promote%20policies%20that%20%26quot%3Bstrengthen%20marriage%20and%20families%2C%20support%20parents%20in%20their%20educational%20mission%20and%20enable%20young%20people%20to%20look%20to%20the%20future%20with%20confidence.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPope%20Leo%20has%20made%20AI%20a%20central%20debate%20since%20the%20early%20days%20of%20his%20papacy.%20Last%20year%2C%20he%20asked%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpope-leo-xiv-ai-morality-justice-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAI%20industry%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20%26quot%3Bcultivate%20moral%20discernment%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bdevelop%20systems%20that%20reflect%20justice%2C%20solidarity%2C%20and%20a%20reverence%20for%20life.%26quot%3B%20In%20May%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpope-leo-ai-encyclical-magnifica-humanitas-takeaways-jobs-developers-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EPope%20Leo%20issued%20a%20letter%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20AI's%20impact%20on%20the%20global%20workforce%2C%20the%20environment%2C%20and%20democracy%2C%20which%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fleaders-ceos-react-pope-leo-ai-encyclical-2026-5%23gerald-leo-posner-author-and-investigative-reporter-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edrew%20responses%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20CEOs%2C%20lawmakers%2C%20and%20academics.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20remarks%20come%20at%20a%20time%20when%20tech%20companies%20are%20urging%20consumers%20to%20integrate%20AI%20into%20nearly%20all%20parts%20of%20their%20daily%20lives.%20While%20AI%20optimists%20say%20the%20tech%20can%20automate%20and%20speed%20up%20tasks%2C%20critics%20worry%20it%20will%20upend%20the%20job%20market%20and%20displace%20human%20workers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMany%20companies%20have%20instructed%20employees%20to%20adopt%20AI%20tools.%20In%20May%2C%20a%20Unitarian%20Uni