ess%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcitadel-performance-july-situational-awarenesss-portfolio-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECitadel%3C%2Fa%3E%20boss%20updated%20clients%20on%20the%20performance%20of%20Citadel%20Wellington%20Fund%2C%20the%20firm's%20flagship%20multi-strategy%20fund%20that%20purchased%20a%20large%20portion%20of%20Situational%20Awareness's%20investments%20last%20month%20as%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fleopold-aschenbrenner-situational-awareness-hedge-fund-public-book-losses-lessons-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20hedge%20fund%20imploded%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20transaction%20strengthened%20Situation%20Awareness's%20balance%20sheet%20and%20helped%20%26quot%3Bmitigate%20the%20risk%20of%20a%20tail%20event%2C%26quot%3B%20Griffin%20wrote%2C%20later%20adding%20that%20the%20firm%20had%20removed%20around%2080%25%20of%20the%20risk%20from%20the%20investments%20it%20purchased.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20successfully%20shed%20more%20than%2080%25%20of%20the%20aggregate%20risk%20from%20the%20original%20portfolio.%20In%20this%20effort%2C%20we%20have%20completed%20nearly%20100%20block%20trades%20totaling%20over%20%244%20billion%20in%20market%20value.%20These%20included%20the%20largest%20intraday%20block%20trades%20of%20the%20year%20in%2010%20different%20names%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20letter%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGriffin%20added%20that%2C%20in%20the%20US%2C%20Citadel%20%26quot%3Bquickly%20exited%20the%20vast%20majority%20of%20the%20vega%20risk%2C%26quot%3B%20or%20the%20risk%20that%20changes%20in%20expected%20volatility%20would%20affect%20the%20value%20of%20its%20options%20positions%2C%20%26quot%3Bsaving%20substantial%20capital%20in%20the%20process.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECitadel%20Wellington%20gained%205.94%25%20over%20the%20month%20of%20July%2C%20putting%20its%20year-to-date%20gains%20at%20over%2012%25%2C%20Griffin%20said.%3C%2Fp