Fworld%2Fuk%2Fwoman-born-without-uterus-breaks-down-as-she-raises-20000-for-transplant-after-spending-nearly-50000-on-ivf-surrogate-and-miscarriage-we-dont-want-to-stop-fighting-yet%2Famp_articleshow%2F133410313.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22After%20living%20in%20California%20for%20decades%2C%20I%20finally%20found%20the%20perfect%20place%20to%20visit%20for%20an%20unforgettable%20weekend%20getaway.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221216%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20and%20woman%20smiling%20in%20Ojai%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a84d4a37e0482203ed175c8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22913%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20fell%20in%20love%20with%20Ojai%20during%20a%20weekend%20getaway%20to%20the%20Southern%20California%20city.%3Cp%3EBlythe%20Chadim%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI've%20spent%20decades%20in%20California%20and%20can%20finally%20say%20Ojai%20is%20the%20perfect%20spot%20for%20a%20weekend%20trip.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOjai%20has%20many%20wellness%20offerings%20and%20a%20small-town%20feel%20with%20lots%20of%20great%20local%20businesses.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFrom%20shopping%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-bookstores-in-the-world-2016-10%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBart's%20Books%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20eating%20at%20Bonnie%20Lu's%2C%20we%20had%20a%20great%20weekend%20getaway.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EGrowing%20up%20in%20the%20San%20Francisco%20Bay%20Area%2C%20I%20have%20visited%20many%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsouthern-california-places-worth-visiting-spots-to-skip-local-recommendations%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebeautiful%20places%20in%20California%3C%2Fa%3E%20over%20the%20years.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20hometown%20offered%20easy%20access%20to%20coastal%20cities%20like%20Santa%20Cruz%20and%20Monterey.%20I've%20also%20explored%20popular%20destinations%20like%20Sonoma%2C%20Napa%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhere-to-eat-palm-springs-california-frequent-visitor-restaurant-recommendations%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPalm%20Springs%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20search%20of%20the%20perfect%20weekend%20getaway.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERecently%2C%20while%20in%20Los%20Angeles%2C%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20planned%20a%20weekend%20stay%20in%20a%20place%20I'd%20always%20wanted%20to%20visit%20%E2%80%94%20Ojai%20(pronounced%20%26quot%3BOh-Hi%26quot%3B).%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Southern%20California%20city%20has%20long%20been%20a%20favorite%20destination%20for%20creative%20types%2C%20attracting%20writers%2C%20artists%2C%20and%20actors%20for%20decades.%20Many%20Hollywood%20stars%2C%20like%20Jon%20Bernthal%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fevery-anne-hathaway-movie-ranked-worst-to-best-with-photos-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnne%20Hathaway%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Emily%20Blunt%2C%20and%20John%20Krasinski%2C%20have%20even%20owned%20homes%20in%20the%20area.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOjai%20seems%20a%20mix%20of%20quiet%20luxury%20and%20bohemian%20eccentricity%2C%20but%20I%20think%20what%20really%20draws%20people%20in%20and%20invites%20them%20to%20stay%20is%20its%20authenticity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%2C%20it's%20my%20No.%201%20recommendation%20for%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffavorite-weekend-trip-southern-california-oceanside-beaches-food-train-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESoCal%20weekend%20getaway%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2233141679-702d-4df4-b438-ddf2682b822d%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EOjai%20feels%20remote%2C%20but%20it's%20surprisingly%20easy%20to%20access%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221364%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Ojai%20Mountain%20View%20from%20Hummingbird%20Inn%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a84d4a385cca0a87cd8a60c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22913%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOjai%20feels%20more%20remote%20than%20it%20really%20is.%3Cp%3EBlythe%20Chadim%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESituated%20between%20the%20Western%20Transverse%20Ranges%20in%20Ventura%20County%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhouse-of-the-day-a-15-million-home-in-the-ojai-mountains-of-california-2011-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOjai%20Valley%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20surrounded%20by%20rolling%20hills%20and%20steeply%20rising%20mountains.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20you%20descend%20into%20the%20valley%2C%20the%20small%20city%20of%20Ojai%20(with%20a%20population%20under%208%2C000)%20seems%20to%20materialize%20out%20of%20nowhere.%20Ranches%20and%20barns%20give%20way%20to%20dozens%20of%20restaurants%2C%20shops%2C%20and%20spas%20in%20the%20walkable%20town%20center%2C%20just%20right%20for%20weekend%20exploration.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20an%20easy%20hour-and-a-half%20drive%20from%20Los%20Angeles%2C%20and%20less%20than%2020%20miles%20inland%20from%20Ventura%2C%20making%20it%20a%20quick%20escape%20from%20the%20city%20that%20feels%20worlds%20away%20from%20everything%20%E2%80%94%20the%20stunning%20views%20of%20the%20Topatopa%20Mountains%20certainly%20help.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220c77f590-762e-4640-b912-6e2bf1da1869%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20small%20city%20feels%20built%20for%20relaxation%20and%20wellness%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221213%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Humingbird%20Inn%20sign%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a84d4a40b0f848e0c306ed6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22913%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAt%20Hummingbird%20Inn%2C%20we%20had%20easy%20access%20to%20downtown.%3Cp%3EBlythe%20Chadim%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOjai%20offers%20a%20variety%20of%20accommodations%20for%20relaxing.%20There%20are%20large%20resorts%2C%20like%20the%20Ojai%20Valley%20Inn%2C%20offering%20glittering%20pools%20and%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F