more%20than%20%2411%20trillion%20over%20the%20last%20five%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdatawrapper.dwcdn.net%2FozTr8%2Fembed.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%20class%3D%5C%22feedlyNoScript%5C%22%3E%3Cimg%20alt%3D%5C%22Line%20chart%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdatawrapper.dwcdn.net%2FozTr8%2Ffull.png%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%20this%20week%2C%20Treasury%20Secretary%20Scott%20Bessent%20stepped%20in%20to%20try%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-market-warning-yields-hit-2007-record-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eease%20skyrocketing%20yields%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20the%2030-year%20US%20Treasury%20yield%20hit%20its%20highest%20level%20since%20June%202007%2C%20as%20investors%20looked%20to%20offload%20bonds%20amid%20continued%20oil%20price%20uncertainty.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftreasury-surprise-move-bond-market-borrowing-costs-wallet-money-explained-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBessent%20took%3C%2Fa%3E%20some%20unexpected%20direct%20action%2C%20implementing%20debt%20buybacks%20on%20longer-term%20federal%20debt%2C%20which%20temporarily%20eased%20yields%2C%20although%20they've%20crept%20back%20up%20in%20the%20following%20days.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F08%2F20%2Fbessent-budget-deficit-trump.html%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBessent%20indicated%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20new%20tariff%20revenue%20could%20take%20a%20bite%20out%20of%20the%20deficit%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bloomberg.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2F2026-08-20%2Fbessent-says-buybacks-could-be-more-than-4-billion-per-issue%3FaccessToken%3DeyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzb3VyY2UiOiJTdWJzY3JpYmVyR2lmdGVkQXJ0aWNsZSIsImlhdCI6MTc4NzI3MTk0NywiZXhwIjoxNzg3ODc2NzQ3LCJhcnRpY2xlSWQiOiJUSzJNRkVLSzNOWTkwMCIsImJjb25uZWN0SWQiOiIyOEUzRDIzNDFGRTU0QjU3QjJDQ0E5QjBGRjNFNDBGRCJ9.HtDNZSotTQT3qEr7o07XI-pM7OjYLmzbBekmgEoBX84%26leadSource%3Darticle-gifting%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ealso%20signaled%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20the%20administration%20could%20continue%20those%20buybacks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BActions%20like%20these%20can%20make%20a%20modest%20difference%20for%20rates%20in%20the%20short%20term%2C%20but%20only%20reducing%20deficits%20will%20provide%20the%20long-term%20fix%2C%26quot%3B%20Caleb%20Quakenbush%2C%20the%20director%20of%20fiscal%20policy%20at%20the%20Bipartisan%20Policy%20Center%2C%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20growing%20federal%20debt%20could%20hit%20Americans%20in%20their%20pockets.%20As%20the%20federal%20government's%20debt%20load%20grows%2C%20lenders%20may%20seek%20higher%20interest%20rates%20to%20compensate%20for%20higher%20risk.%20That%20in%20turn%20can%20push%20up%20interest%20rates%20on%20the%20larger%20purchases%20that%20are%20most%20important%20to%20many%20consumers%20%E2%80%94%20think%20mortgages%20and%20auto%20loans.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOur%20nation's%20lenders%2C%20concerned%20about%20the%20lack%20of%20a%20plan%20to%20get%20our%20fiscal%20house%20in%20order%2C%20are%20asking%20taxpayers%20to%20pay%20more%20for%20what%20government%20borrows%2C%26quot%3B%20Quakenbush%20said.%20%26quot%3BThat%20also%20raises%20the%20cost%20of%20debt%20for%20everyone%20else.%20If%20a%20mortgage%20is%20out%20of%20reach%2C%20or%20financing%20for%20your%20business%20has%20gotten%20more%20expensive%2C%20the%20debt%20is%20part%20of%20the%20reason.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbudgetlab.yale.edu%2Fresearch%2Fimpact-deficits-costs-households%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EYale%20Budget%20Lab%20found%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20when%20lawmakers%20raise%20deficits%20without%20measures%20to%20offset%20those%20costs%2C%20interest%20rates%20tend%20to%20grow.%20Their%20model%20%E2%80%94%20which%20looked%20at%20the%20increase%20in%20federal%20debt%20from%202015%20through%202025%2C%20and%20tracks%20the%20impact%20of%20fiscal%20policy%20on%20interest%20rates%20and%20loans%20as%20of%20the%20third%20quarter%202025%20%E2%80%94%20finds%20that%20the%20federal%20debt%20growth%20over%20that%20period%20raised%20annual%20costs%20by%20%242%2C500%20for%20the%20median%20home%20mortgage%20and%20%24120%20for%20the%20average%20auto%20loan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhile%20%2440T%20itself%20is%20hard%20to%20conceptualize%20in%20total%2C%20per%20person%20it's%20upwards%20of%20%24100k%2C%26quot%3B%20Abhi%20Gupta%2C%20the%20author%20of%20the%20Yale%20analysis%2C%20said.%20%26quot%3BIn%20the%20same%20way%20homeowners%20take%20seriously%20the%20responsibility%20of%20making%20their%20mortgage%20payments%2C%20the%20national%20debt%20is%20large%20enough%20to%20deserve%20a%20similar%20level%20of%20consideration%20%E2%80%94%20both%20because%20any%20realistic%20plan%20to%20bring%20it%20down%20involves%20tradeoffs%20and%20because%20its%20growth%20makes%20all%20sorts%20of%20other%20borrowing%20more%20expensive%20too.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-debt-reaches-40-trillion-what-means-mortgage-loans-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787332437000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8872374569a4ec219f8e2e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-debt-reaches-40-trillion-what-means-mortgage-loans-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22America's%20national%20debt%20rose%20to%20over%20%2440%20trillion%20this%20week%2C%20and%20it%20might%20mean%20your%20mortgage%20or%20auto%20loans%20could%20get%20more%20expensive.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jkaplan%40businessinsider.com%20(Juliana%20Kaplan)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A94%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22ChatGPT%20has%20entered%20the%20group%20chat.%20Texters%20have%E2%80%A6feelings%20about%20it.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222120%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20close-up%20of%20a%20person's%20hands%20holding%20and%20typing%20on%20a%20phone%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F66841a0a268f62ba18a69e80%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221414%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20announced%20a%20feature%20that%20lets%20texters%20write%20and%20send%20messages%20with%20ChatGPT.%3Cp%3ETim%20Robberts%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOpenAI%20launched%20a%20plugin%20that%20lets%20ChatGPT%20draft%20and%20send%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-trial-exposes-truth-about-workplace-texts-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etext%20messages%3C%2Fa%3E%20within%20iMessage%20on%20a%20Mac.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20feature%20drew%20backlash%20from%20many%20texters%20online.%20One%20called%20it%20an%20%26quot%3Bopen-book%20'are%20you%20an%20idiot'%20test.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOthers%20worried%20about%20the%20privacy%20implications%20of%20giving%20ChatGPT%20access%20to%20all%20your%20texts.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EA%20hot%20new%20bombshell%20has%20entered%20the%20group%20chat%3A%20ChatGPT.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20announced%20a%20new%20plugin%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fiphone-apple-text-message-imessage-recording-voice-memo-be-careful-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EApple%20Messages%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20Thursday.%20On%20a%20Mac%2C%20ChatGPT%20can%20now%20search%20your%20text%20messages%2C%20draft%20replies%2C%20and%20hit%20send.%20The%20company%20suggested%20using%20prompts%20to%20look%20for%20birthday%20or%20spam%20messages%20to%20delete.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20launch%20cracked%20open%20a%20debate%3A%20how%20human%20should%20your%20text%20chats%20be%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3