rotest-investment-meta-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EEveryone*%20hates%20data%20centers%3C%2Fa%3E%20now.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHow%20did%20that%20happen%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20lots%20of%20theories%3A%20People%20are%20worried%20about%20the%20environment.%20Or%20electric%20bills.%20Or%20their%20jobs.%20Or%20imperious%20Big%20Tech%20billionaires%20ordering%20them%20around.%20All%20of%20the%20above.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%3A%20It's%20China's%20fault.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20last%20one%20doesn't%20come%20up%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fnews.gallup.com%2Fpoll%2F709772%2Famericans-oppose-data-centers-area.aspx%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epolling%3C%2Fa%3E.%20But%20it's%20quite%20popular%20on%20certain%20corners%20of%20the%20pro-AI%20internet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20theory%20spelled%20out%3A%20China%20wants%20Americans%20to%20turn%20against%20AI%20data%20centers%2C%20so%20that%20America%20will%20fall%20behind%20China%20in%20the%20AI%20race.%20So%20it%20is%20using%20the%20internet%20to%20brainwash%20Americans%20to%20hate%20data%20centers.%20A%20psyop%2C%20per%20prominent%20VC%20Garry%20Tan%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fplatform.x.com%2Fwidgets.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22twitter%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cblockquote%20class%3D%5C%22twitter-tweet%5C%22%3E%3Cp%20lang%3D%5C%22en%5C%22%20dir%3D%5C%22ltr%5C%22%3EReminder%3A%20the%20datacenter%20discourse%20is%20a%20documented%20psyop%20and%20they%E2%80%99re%20winning%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ft.co%2FIfhGLmHwuL%5C%22%3Ehttps%3A%2F%2Ft.co%2FIfhGLmHwuL%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%E2%80%94%20Garry%20Tan%20(%40garrytan)%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fgarrytan%2Fstatus%2F2090779018853499268%3Fref_src%3Dtwsrc%255Etfw%5C%22%3EAugust%2021%2C%202026%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%5Cn%5Cn%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EIs%20that%20possible%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaaaaaaaybe%3A%20In%20June%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.openai.com%2Fpdf%2F96b559fa-c165-4575-805d-e636909e2f78%2FJune-2026-Threat-Report.pdf%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOpenAI%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20it%20had%20evidence%20some%20China-linked%20accounts%20were%20trying%20to%20use%20ChatGPT%20to%20generate%20anti-AI%20content%20they%20could%20distribute%20on%20social%20media%2C%20like%20this%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22552%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22images%20of%20anti-AI%20messages%20OpenAI%20says%20Chinese%20users%20created%20using%20ChatGPT%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8870138a99fa493d60ed5c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221422%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20says%20users%20linked%20to%20China%20created%20these%20anti-AI%20messages%20using%20ChatGPT.%3Cp%3EOpenAI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20that%20same%20report%20said%20it%20didn't%20have%20any%20evidence%20that%20those%20efforts%20had%20shifted%20public%20opinion.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20after%20celebrity%20investor%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkevin-oleary-utah-data-center-messed-up-messaging-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EKevin%20O'Leary%20accused%20opponents%20of%20his%20Utah%20data%20center%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20working%20on%20behalf%20of%20China%2C%20he%20later%20acknowledged%20that%20he%20had%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fkevinolearytv%2Fstatus%2F2070227278169059350%3Fs%3D20%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eno%20evidence%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20that%20was%20true%2C%20and%20walked%20the%20claim%20back%20(so%20did%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkevin-oleary-data-center-apology-fox-news-china-opponents-claim-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFox%20News%3C%2Fa%3E).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20would%20not%20be%20surprising%20if%20it%20eventually%20turns%20out%20that%20there%20%3Cem%3Ewas%3C%2Fem%3E%20a%20coordinated%20social%20media%20campaign%20to%20try%20to%20influence%20how%20Americans%20feel%20about%20AI%20and%20data%20centers.%20All%20kinds%20of%20people%20use%20social%20media%20to%20try%20to%20influence%20sentiment.%20And%20after%20the%202016%20election%2C%20social%20media%20platforms%20started%20paying%20extra%20attention%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftransparency.meta.com%2Fmetasecurity%2Fthreat-reporting%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edocumenting%20covert%20efforts%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20tried%20to%20do%20that.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20also%20possible%20that%20it's%20easier%20for%20bad%20actors%20to%20act%20badly%20on%20social%20media%20right%20now.%20In%20the%20years%20after%20Elon%20Musk%20bought%20Twitter%2C%20social%20media%20platforms%20have%20gutted%20the%20trust%20and%20safety%20teams%20that%20used%20to%20monitor%20those%20platforms.%20Outside%20watchdogs%2C%20like%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.platformer.news%2Fstanford-internet-observatory-shutdown-stamos-diresta-sio%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EStanford%20Internet%20Observatory%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20have%20been%20shuttered%20or%20neutered.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20again%3A%20Everyone%20who%20owns%20a%20big%20social%20media%20platform%20in%20the%20US%20is%20%3Cem%3Ealso%3C%2Fem%3E%20pouring%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-bubble-burst-stock-market-crash-boom-dotcom-financial-crisis-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emany%20tens%20of%20billions%20into%20AI%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20much%20of%20which%20is%20going%20to%20US%20data%20center%20projects.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20if%20you%20think%20that%20X%2C%20or%20Meta's%20Facebook%20and%20Instagram%2C%20or%20Google's%20YouTube%2C%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FJTLonsdale%2Fstatus%2F2090657679031288154%3Fs%3D46%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETikTok%3C%2Fa%3E%20(whose%20US%20operations%20are%20partly%20owned%20by%20Larry%20Ellison's%20Oracle)%20are%20being%20used%20to%20turn%20Americans%20against%20AI%2C%20you'd%20think%20that%20those%20platforms%20might%20be%20doing%20something%20to%20stop%20that.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstead%2C%20the%20Big%20Tech%20industry's%20main%20response%20to%20Americans%20not%20liking%20its%20AI%20plans%20is%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Falexisohanian%2Fstatus%2F2090779826135179431%3Fs%3D46%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Electure%20people%20online%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchamath-palihapitiya-ai-data-center-backlash-warning-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecomplain%20about%20the%20industry's%20messaging%3C%2Fa%3E.%20(%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-ai-data-center-one-billion-dollar-fund-backlash-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EMeta%20has%20also%20just%20dangled%20a%20%241%20billion%20fund%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20towns%20that%20host%20its%20data%20centers.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20%26quot%3Bwe%20need%20a%20better%20message%2Fmessenger%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bour%20message%20isn't%20working%20because%20of%20China%26quot%3B%20are%20two%20sides%20of%20the%20same%20coin%3A%20The%20belief%20that%20people%20are%20misguided%20because%20they've%20been%20misguided%2C%20and%20not%20because%20they%20actually%20feel%20that%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20if%20that%20sounds%20familiar%2C%20think%20about%20your%20own%20reactions%20to%20things%20you%20can't%20abide%20%E2%80%94%20like%2C%20say%2C%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdonald-trump-wins-presidential-election-race-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eelection%20result%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20quite%20tempting%20to%20blame%20Mark%20Zuckerberg%20or%20Rupert%20Murdoch%20for%20the%20fact%20that%20many%20of%20your%20fellow%20citizens%20voted%20for%20someone%20or%20something%20you%20find%20abhorrent.%20It's%20much%20harder%20to%20grapple%20with%20the%20fact%20that%20many%20of%20your%20fellow%20citizens%20hold%20beliefs%20you%20can't%20stand.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWelcome%20to%20t