%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20I%20knew%20I'd%20be%20moving%20around%2C%20I%20needed%20to%20keep%20my%20belongings%20light%20enough%20for%20easy%20transportation%20%E2%80%94%20and%2C%20of%20course%2C%20I%20wanted%20to%20leave%20room%20for%20the%20things%20I'd%20inevitably%20buy%20along%20the%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGoing%20from%20my%20two-bedroom%20apartment%2C%20packed%20closet%2C%20and%20bathroom%20full%20of%20products%20to%20a%20small%20rotation%20of%20outfits%2C%20toiletries%2C%20and%20necessities%20has%20definitely%20been%20an%20adjustment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20that%2C%20I'm%20glad%20I%20downsized%20my%20belongings.%20The%20experience%20has%20taught%20me%20to%20live%20with%20a%20lot%20less%2C%20and%20I%20made%20some%20pretty%20good%20choices%20about%20what%20to%20bring%20abroad.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20there%20are%20also%20a%20few%20things%20I%20didn't%20think%20I'd%20need%20that%20I'm%20really%20missing%20now.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20are%20the%20three%20things%20I'm%20glad%20I%20packed%20%E2%80%94%20and%20a%20few%20I%20wish%20I'd%20brought.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20did%20a%20great%20job%20creating%20a%20capsule%20wardrobe.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20wearing%20a%20black%20skirt%20and%20white%20tank%20top%2C%20standing%20with%20suitcases%20in%20front%20of%20a%20train.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a848c2385cca0a87cd8a2d6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20packed%20a%20lot%20of%20black-and-white%20clothing%20so%20I'd%20be%20able%20to%20mix%20and%20match%20tons%20of%20outfits.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20moving%2C%20I%20spent%20a%20long%20time%20thinking%20about%20which%20clothing%20items%20to%20bring.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20didn't%20want%20to%20use%20up%20my%20entire%20suitcase%2C%20because%20I%20knew%20I'd%20need%20room%20for%20any%20new%20clothes%20I%20bought%20in%20Japan.%20I%20also%20wanted%20to%20be%20able%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fstyle%2Fbusiness-casual-outfits-busy-women%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emix%20and%20match%20outfits%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEventually%2C%20I%20landed%20on%20two%20pairs%20of%20jeans%2C%20a%20pair%20of%20jean%20shorts%2C%20sneakers%2C%20waterproof%20boots%2C%20two%20long-sleeve%20shirts%2C%20two%20sweaters%2C%20a%20dress%2C%20two%20skirts%2C%20four%20tank%20tops%2C%20and%20a%20few%20jackets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20love%20having%20basic%2C%20neutral%20black-and-white%20clothes%20that%20all%20pair%20together%2C%20so%20it's%20easy%20to%20stay%20functional%20and%20stylish%20without%20looking%20like%20I%20wear%20the%20same%20thing%20every%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI'm%20glad%20I%20brought%20a%20folding%20toiletry%20bag.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221414%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20folding%20toiletry%20bag%20with%20hair%20products%2C%20makeup%20items%2C%20and%20more%20hangs%20on%20the%20writer's%20dresser.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a848d947e0482203ed17290%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221074%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EInvesting%20in%20a%20transportable%2C%20folding%20toiletry%20bag%20was%20a%20smart%20call.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20always%20packed%20separate%20bags%20for%20my%20makeup%2C%20hairbrushes%2C%20toothbrush%2C%20and%20all%20my%20jewelry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstead%20of%20doing%20that%20this%20time%20around%2C%20I%20decided%20to%20try%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftravel%2Fbest-toiletry-bag%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efolding%20toiletry%20bag%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20it's%20been%20a%20total%20game%20changer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%20I%20can%20fit%20my%20accessories%2C%20makeup%2C%20razors%2C%20and%20everything%20else%20into%20one%20place.%20It%20folds%20up%20easily%2C%20fits%20into%20my%20suitcase%2C%20and%20I%20can%20just%20open%20it%20up%20and%20hang%20it%20in%20the%20bathroom%20whenever%20I'm%20getting%20ready.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMy%20portable%20monitor%20was%20a%20smart%20investment.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221370%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer's%20desk%20setup%2C%20with%20a%20laptop%2C%20keyboard%2C%20portable%20monitor%2C%20mouse%2C%20and%20paperback%20book.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a848e7c0b0f848e0c306bbc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221022%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20bought%20a%20new%20portable%20monitor%20before%20moving%20abroad.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20was%20a%20purchase%20I%20made%20specifically%20for%20Japan%2C%20and%20I%20would've%20had%20a%20much%20harder%20time%20using%20my%20laptop%20without%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%20my%20first%20monitor%20when%20I%20was%20a%20teacher%2C%20and%20it%20completely%20changed%20how%20I%20worked.%20I%20always%20have%20a%20million%20tabs%20open%20so%20I%20can%20do%20multiple%20things%20at%20once%2C%20and%20a%20second%20screen%20makes%20a%20huge%20difference.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20portable%20monitor%20is%20super%20slim%2C%20and%20it%20fits%20easily%20in%20my%20computer%20bag%20or%20carry-on.%20Plus%2C%20it%20came%20in%20handy%20when%20I%20stayed%20at%20an%20Airbnb%20in%20Tokyo%20without%20a%20TV%20%E2%80%94%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20used%20it%20as%20a%20screen%20so%20we%20could%20play%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fnintendo-switch-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENintendo%20Switch%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20definitely%20glad%20I%20brought%20it%2C%20and%20I%20plan%20to%20keep%20using%20it%20when%20I'm%20back%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOn%20the%20other%20hand%2C%20I%20should've%20packed%20more%20of%20my%20go-to%20hair%20product.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221362%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20posing%20for%20a%20selfie%2C%20wearing%20black%20sunglasses%20and%20showcasing%20curly%20hair.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a848f240b0f848e0c306bbe%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221082%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20underestimated%20how%20difficult%20it%20would%20be%20to%20find%20a%20reliable%20hair%20product%20abroad.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20a%20few%20things%20I%20wish%20I'd%20packed%20more%20of%2C%20mainly%20because%20I%20underestimated%20how%20expensive%20or%20difficult%20they'd%20be%20to%20find%20in%20Japan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20have%20naturally%20thick%2C%20curly%20hair%2C%20and%20I%20can't%20just%20use%20any%20product%20on%20it.%20Curly-haired%20people%20get%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20been%20loyal%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fbeauty%2Ffavorite-curly-girl-hair-products%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emy%20favorite%20curl%20gel%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20years%2C%20and%20it's%20the%20only%20product%20I%20really%20need%20after%20my%20wash%20days%20%E2%80%94%20but%20because%20it's%20so%20popular%2C%20it%20usually%20sells%20out%20for%20months%20at%20a%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%20my%20hands%20on%20some%20before%20moving%20and%20brought%20a%20dupe%20product%20with%20me%2C%20but%20that%20only%20lasted%20a%20few%20months.%20Since%20then%2C%20I%20haven't%20found%20anything%20similar%20that%20works%20for%20my%20hair%20type%20in%20stores.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20also%20noticed%20that%20curly%20hair%20products%20are%20significantly%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Emore%20expensive%20on%20Amazon%20Japan.%20One%20product%20I've%20used%20as%20a%20dupe%20costs%20around%20CA%2429%20on%20Amazon%20Canada%2C%20but%20almost%20CA%2450%20on%20Amazon%20Japan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20hindsight%2C%20giving%20up%20the%20extra%20suitcase%20space%20for%20more%20product%20would've%20been%20well%20worth%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAntiperspirant%20deodorant%20has%20been%20difficult%20to%20find.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221384%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20checkered%20bag%20next%20to%20Suave%20deodorant%20and%20curl-enhancing%20gel.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a84908f0b0f848e0c306bd1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221058%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20should've%20packed%20much%20more%20deodorant.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBack%20in%20Canada%2C%20I%20was%20used%20to%20summer%20days%20that%20reached%2085%20degrees%20Fahrenheit%20or%20more%2C%20but%20I%20always%20found%20the%20heat%20somewhat%20dry.%20Here%20in%20Japan%2C%20I've%20spent%20time%20in%20the%20Kyushu%20region%20when%20most%20days%20were%20about%2095%20degrees%20Fahrenheit%20with%20lots%20of%20humidity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20stepped%20outside%2C%20it%20genuinely%20felt%20like%20I%20was%20walking%20into%20a%20wet%20wall%20of%20heat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20coming%20here%2C%20I%20figured%20I'd%20be%20able%20to%20find%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsecret-clinical-vs-cheap-suave-deodorant-review-antiperspirant-2023-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWestern-style%20deodorant%3C%2Fa%3E.%20I%20tried%20a%20few%2C%20but%20found%20them%20to%20be%20a%3Cem%3E%20lot%20%3C%2Fem%3Elighter%20than%20the%20products%20I%20was%20used%20to%2C%20and%20I'd%20sweat%20them%20off%20immediately.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELuckily%2C%20my%20sister-in-law%20came%20to%20the%20rescue%20with%20a%20couple%20of%20sticks%20when%20she%20visited%20%E2%80%94%20but%20if%20I%20had%20a%20do-over%2C%20I'd%20definitely%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Epack%20more.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20wish%20I'd%20brought%20better%20running%20shoes.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221392%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20wearing%20a%20blue%20dress%20and%20white%20sneakers%20and%20sitting%20on%20a%20ledge%20in%20Japan.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8491ae7e0482203ed172b6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221064%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI've%20been%20walking%20around%20much%20more%20than%20I%20expected.%3Cp%3EAlessa%20Hickman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20coming%20to%20Japan%2C%20I%20bought%20a%20new%20pair%20of%20sneakers%20online.%20Unfortunately%2C%20within%20a%20few%20months%20of%20daily%20walking%2C%20they%20broke%20down%2C%20and%20I%20had%20to%20get%20rid%20of%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20wouldn't%20normally%20be%20a%20huge%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Edeal%2C%20but%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fstyle%2Fmost-comfortable-dress-shoes-for-women%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efinding%20shoes%20in%20my%20size%3C%2Fa%3E%20here%20is%20pretty%20difficult.%20I'm%20usually%20a%20size%209%20US%2C%20sometimes%20a%2010%2C%20and%20I've%20found%20that%20most%20Japanese%20stores%20don't%20carry%20above%20an%208.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20able%20to%20find%20my%20size%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsneakers-worn-by-tech-execs-2017-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOnitsuka%20Tiger%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20that's%20where%20I'll%20probably%20go%20for%20my%20next%20pair%20of%20runners.%20Still%2C%20I%20wish%20I'd%20either%20bought%20two%20pairs%20of%20sneakers%20or%20invested%20in%20better-quality%20ones%20from%20the%20get-go.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoving-to-japan-packing-list-mistakes-what-to-bring-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787329141000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a848a5d85cca0a87cd8a2c4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoving-to-japan-packing-list-mistakes-what-to-bring-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22When%20I%20moved%20to%20Japan%20for%20a%20year%2C%20I%20just%20packed%20a%20suitcase%20and%20carry-on.%20There%20are%20a%20few%20things%2C%20like%20deodorant%2C%20that%20I%20wish%20I'd%20brought%20from%20home.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Alessa%20Hickman)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22WPP%20seeks%20to%20seal%20'highly%20confidential%20and%20sensitive'%20client%20information%20from%20lawsuit%20with%20former%20exec%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22WPP%20Logo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a88581b1d1a1d028ba11a22%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWPP%20is%20fighting%20back%20against%20a%20lawsuit%20filed%20by%20one%20of%20its%20former%20executives.%3Cp%3EWPP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EWPP%20alleges%20in%20a%20legal%20filing%20that%20a%20former%20exec%20improperly%20leaked%20sensitive%20information%20in%20his%20lawsuit%20against%20the%20company.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWPP%20is%20asking%20the%20court%20to%20seal%20several%20paragraphs%2C%20figures%2C%20and%20exhibits%20from%20the%20lawsuit.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EA%20lawyer%20for%20the%20former%20exec%20said%20he%20will%20%26quot%3Boppose%20any%20attempt%20to%20seal%20the%20facts%20of%20this%20case.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAd%20giant%20WPP%20is%20fighting%20back%20against%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flawsuit-fired-wpp-exec-alleges-retaliation-over-rebate-concerns-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20lawsuit%3C%2Fa%3E%20filed%20by%20one%20of%20its%20former%20executives%2C%20alleging%20that%20he%20improperly%20leaked%20sensitive%20trade%20secrets%20and%20client%20data%20that%20could%20jeopardize%20its%20business.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20lawsuit%2C%20from%20former%20WPP%20exec%20Richard%20Foster%2C%20accuses%20the%20company%20of%20retaliating%20against%20him%20and%20firing%20him%20after%20he%20raised%20concerns%20that%20the%20group's%20media%20investment%20division%20was%20allegedly%20running%20an%20improper%20global%20kickback%20operation.%20In%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flawsuit-alleges-sony-investigation-into-wpp-rebates-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20new%20filing%3C%2Fa%3E%20added%20to%20the%20case%20last%20week%2C%20Foster's%20legal%20team%20included%20details%20of%20a%20purported%20investigation%20by%20WPP%20client%20Sony%20that%20said%20WPP%20had%20run%20a%20%26quot%3Bfraud%20scheme%26quot%3B%20in%20China%20and%20other%20markets%2C%20in%20which%20it%20improperly%20withheld%20rebates%20from%20its%20clients.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP's%20lawyers%20on%20Thursday%20filed%20a%20motion%20to%20seal%20from%20public%20view%20several%20paragraphs%2C%20figures%2C%20and%20exhibits%20from%20within%20Foster's%20amended%20complaint.%20In%20a%20memo%20to%20support%20its%20proposed%20order%20to%20seal%2C%20WPP%20argues%20Foster's%20complaint%20is%20stacked%20with%20%26quot%3Bimmaterial%20and%20salacious%20allegations%26quot%3B%20designed%20to%20harass%20the%20ad%20agency%20group%20and%20its%20clients.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP%20declined%20to%20comment%20on%20the%20latest%20filings.%20Sony%20declined%20to%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWilliam%20A.%20Brewer%20III%2C%20partner%20at%20Brewer%2C%20Attorneys%20%26amp%3B%20Counselors%20and%20lead%20counsel%20to%20Foster%2C%20said%20in%20a%20statement%20that%20it%20was%20reviewing%20WPP's%20motion.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMr.%20Foster%20will%20oppose%20any%20attempt%20to%20seal%20the%20facts%20of%20this%20case%20from%20those%20with%20an%20interest%20in%20this%20matter%2C%26quot%3B%20Brewer%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP%20argues%20in%20its%20filing%20that%20Sony%20is%20an%20uninvolved%20party%20to%20the%20case%20and%20that%20its%20privacy%20should%20be%20protected.%20WPP%20says%20that%20the%20inclusion%20of%20Sony's%20purported%20investigation%20into%20WPP%20is%20irrelevant%20to%20Foster's%20argument%20because%20the%20alleged%20events%20took%20place%20in%20China%2C%20where%20Foster%20didn't%20work%2C%20and%20happened%20after%20he%20was%20terminated%20from%20the%20company.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP%20also%20argues%20that%20Foster's%20complaint%20reveals%20%26quot%3Bhighly%20confidential%2C%20proprietary%20and%20competitively%20sensitive%20business%20information%26quot%3B%20about%20its%20own%20business%2C%20including%20financial%20and%20performance%20records%2C%20client%20lists%2C%20alleged%20threats%20to%20its%20business%2C%20and%20forward-looking%20business%20strategies.%20WPP%20submitted%20to%20the%20court%20the%20confidentiality%20agreement%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EFoster%20signed%20in%202018%2C%20which%20included%20language%20prohibiting%20him%20from%20disclosing%20confidential%20information%20or%20trade%20secrets%20about%20the%20company%20or%20its%20clients%2C%20either%20during%20his%20employment%20or%20after%20his%20termination.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP%20alleges%20in%20the%20filing%20that%20Foster%20also%20violated%20attorney-client%20privilege%20protections%20by%20including%20details%20in%20his%20lawsuit%20about%20private%20conversations%20he%20had%20with%20WPP's%20in-house%20lawyer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20contends%20that%20in%20disclosing%20the%20sensitive%20materials%2C%20Foster%20sought%20to%20embarrass%20his%20former%20employer%20and%20jeopardize%20its%20%26quot%3Bcompetitive%20position%20in%20the%20entertainment%20and%20advertising%20industry.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20addition%20of%20salacious%2C%20muckraking%20allegations%20and%20disclosure%20of%20highly%20sensitive%20and%2For%20privileged%20information%20in%20the%20Amended%20Complaint%20cannot%20change%20the%20brutal%20truth%3A%20Plaintiff%20is%20not%20and%20never%20has%20been%20a%20whistleblower%2C%20and%20this%20entire%20lawsuit%20is%20nothing%20more%20than%20a%20disgruntled%20employee's%20naked%20attempt%20to%20leverage%20an%20exorbitant%20payout%2C%26quot%3B%20WPP%20says%20in%20its%20filing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFoster%20had%20previously%20turned%20down%20a%20%26quot%3Bseven-figure%20termination%20package%20which%20included%20an%20obligation%20of%20silence%20regarding%20the%20company's%20undisclosed%20rebate%20practices%2C%26quot%3B%20according%20to%20his%20amended%20complaint%2C%20filed%20last%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWPP%20says%20in%20its%20new%20filing%20that%20its%20objections%20to%20the%20disclosure%20of%20privileged%20and%20confidential%20information%20shouldn't%20be%20construed%20as%20an%20admission%20to%20the%20accuracy%20of%20the%20allegations%20within%20Foster's%20complaint.%20WPP%20says%20it%20intends%20to%20file%20an%20updated%20motion%20to%20dismiss%20the%20case%2C%20which%20it%20says%20in%20the%20filing%20will%20further%20address%20%26quot%3Bthe%20deficiencies%26quot%3B%20in%20Foster's%20complaint.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwpp-seal-lawsuit-former-executive-richard-foster-sony-china-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787328913000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8858381d1a1d028ba11a25%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwpp-seal-lawsuit-former-executive-richard-foster-sony-china-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22WPP%20says%20recent%20lawsuit%20filed%20by%20an%20ex-employee%2C%20is%20a%20%26quot%3Bnaked%20attempt%20to%20leverage%20an%20exorbitant%20payout.%26quot%3B%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22loreilly%40businessinsider.com%20(Lara%20O'Reilly)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A93%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%20Jensen%20Huang%20double-signed%20workstation%20Blackwell%20GPU%20sold%20for%20over%20%2457%2C000%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Jensen%20Huang%20looks%20on%20at%20GTC%202026%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.